<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Ngulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli yedi iwandikwe ni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohana</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongoelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana ni kitabu kimwenga mwe vitabu vine ve Ndagano Im'pya vikulonga wikazi wa Yesu Kilisito. Vitabu ivo ivine nivo vikwitangwa Injili, nuko kugamba Mbuli Yedi, vawandikagwa ni Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohana, aho Yesu eze ande kabanika. Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana vadahika neiwandikwa ni Yohana uyo andaga mwigala Ulosi, hamwenga na kugamba kitabu iki hakikulonga ivo, mna Mbuli Yedi ino iwandikwa mwo mwaka wa milongo kenda kulawa aho Yesu eze elekwe. Miwandikile ya ikitabu iki, yaliganisa ne miwandikile ye baluwa ya nk'hongo na ya kaidi ne baluwa ya katatu awandike Yohana. Wawandishi wakale wamwenga wamwiika Yohana kugamba umwo Mbuli Yedi ino yandaga ikawandikwa, yehe Yohana andaga akekala mwo mzi wa Efeso, ivo yadahika kugamba kitabu iki chawandikwa mo mzi wa Efeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohana atambalisa kugamba aunga kitabu iki kiwambize want'hu wahuwile kugamba Yesu niye Kilisito, naho niye Mwana Mnungu. 20:31. Kwa kuhuwila ivi, chanda na ugima kwa zina dyakwe. Kitabu iki wawandikilwa want'hu wose, Wayahudi na want'hu hi Wayahudi. Mbuli Yedi iwandikwe ni Yohana indilisa vituhu na ziya Mbuli Zedi zint'huhu. Yehe akaulisaga mwe vihungi adamanyaga Yesu na hawandikise mwe mbuli ye miliganyizo. Naho hawandike mbuli nk'hulu zilaile enga viya kubatizwa kwa Yesu na magezo yakwe uko kwe nyika.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yemndani</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana aikonga Mbuli Yedi. 1:1-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Akajika awandika vihungi mfungate ivo Yesu adamanye. 1:19-12:50.</para>
  <para style="io">Vikatimila na kutambalisa mbuli nyingi zilaile mwo wikazi wa Yesu zimwigale kubula kwe file yakwe na kuuyuka kwake. 13:1-20:31.</para>
  <para style="io">Yohana abindiliza Mbuli Yedi mo 21 akatambalisa yalailaga zuwa dimwenga hadya Yesu awalailaga want'hu aho eze auyuke, niyo naho Yohana kitalo chakwe mwo kuandika kitabu iki.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ulosi ukukink'ha ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Aho nk'hongo handaga na Ulosi, naho uyo Ulosi andaga hamwenga na Mnungu, naho uyo Ulosi andaga Mnungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kukongela nk'hongo Ulosi andaga hamwenga na Mnungu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yehe niye alekaga vose vikalaila, andile hiyo yehe, hakwalaile kint'hu chochose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yehe andaga chotoko cho ugima. Naho udya ugima wandaga ung'azi wa want'hu. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ung'azi wang'ala mwe diziza, naho diziza hadikuudaha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Halailaga mnt'hu asiigilwe ni Mnungu, etangagwa Yohana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Uyo ezaga vileke alonge uwona wo ung'azi, vileke want'hu wose wahuwile kwombokela kwa uwo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mna yehe andaga hiyo udya ung'azi mna ezaga vileke alonge uwona wo ung'azi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Uno wandaga ung'azi we kindedi, ung'azi ukwiza kwe isi no kuwang'azila want'hu wose. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Andaga mwe Isi naho kwombokela yehe, Mnungu aumbaga isi, mna want'hu we isi waswesa kumkombaganya. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ezaga mwe isi yakwe mwenye mna want'hu we isi yakwe hawamhokele. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mna wadya wamhokele na kudihuwila dizina dyakwe, awenk'haga udahi kunda wana Mnungu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hawelekwe kimnt'humnt'hu kunda wanda Mnungu hegu kwa miungile ya mnt'hu, mna ni kwa kuunga kwakwe Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yudya Ulosi niyo anda mnt'hu no kwikala kwetu, naswe nekiuona uwedi wakwe utendese, uwedi utendese enga wa Mwana haheina mtuhu enga yehe alaile kwa Tate, kamema uwedi ne ikindedi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yohana naakawagambila want'hu ikindedi che zimbuli za yudya Ulosi kwa kubongeela akagamba, “Uyo niye nalongaga zimbuli zakwe, ‘Eyuko akwiza kunyuma kwangu mna nakanilongoela kwaviya andaga uuko, umwo miye nandaga hinati kunda uuko.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kulawa mo uwingi we wedi wakwe Mnungu choseni kihokela uvikilwa, akakink'ha suwe uvikilwa ubindile wingi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaviya Mnungu nakenk'hiza miko kombokela kwa Musa, uwedi ne kindedi neviletwa ni Yesu Kilisito. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hahali mnt'hu amuonaga Mnungu lupisi lwolwose, ila Mwana haheina mtuhu enga yehe eli Mnungu, andile hagihi na Mnungu Tate, niye akigambile mbuli za Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 3:1-12; Maliko 1:1-8; Luka 3:1-18</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>uno nuwo uwona ulavigwe ni Yohana mwo Wayahudi wawasigiilaga walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na Walawi kulawa Yelusalemu waite kwa Yohana wakamuuze, “Weye ni weye ani?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yohana halemele kuwahitula, awagambilaga haheina kifiso akawagamba, “Miye hiyo Kilisito.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Niyo wamuuza, “Haluse weye ni weye ani? Weye niweye Eliya.” Niyo awahitula, “Miye hiyo Eliya.” Niyo wamuuza vituhu, “Haluse ni weye yudya mlotezi?” Niyo awagamba, “Hiyo miye.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Naho niyo wamuuza, “Haluse weye ni weye ani? Uleke kikawagambile wadya wakisigiile. Weye mwenye wakegamba ni weye ani?” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohana niyo awahitula kugamba, “Miye ni yudya alongaga Mlotezi ywa Mnungu Isaya zimbuli zangu kugamba,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Izwi dya mnt'hu akubongeela kwe nyika.</para>
  <para style="q">Ichululeni sila ya Zumbe.’ ” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Na wadya wasigiilwe nawatumigwa ni Mafalisayo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Niyo wamuuza kugamba, “Nii wabatiza want'hu uneva weye hiyo Kilisito, naho hiyo Eliya hegu yudya mlotezi?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yohana niyo awahitula, “Miye nabatiza kwa mazi mna mgati mwenyu eyaho akimale uyo nyuwe hemwimmanyize. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yehe eza kunyuma kwangu mna miye hiwagilwe mbwitu kuhambula luzigi lwe vilatu vakwe.”<figure style="fig" desc="" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="1:27">Mnt'hu anyinya sigi za vilatu</figure> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mbuli izi zalailaga Besania ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani, kudya andagaga Yohana akabatiza.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye ngoto ywa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Zuwa ditimile Yohana niyo amuona Yesu eza kwakwe, niyo agamba, “Kauleni, Mwanangoto ywa Mnungu ikuusa wavu we ino isi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Uyu ni yudya nandaga halonga izimbuli zakwe, ‘Eyuko akwiza kunyuma kwangu mna ni mkulu kujink'ha miye Kwaviya na kanda uuko kukongela miye hinati nelekwe.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Naho miye hyammanyize, mna ni kwa kuunga Izilaeli wammanye, nivo valekile heza kubatiza want'hu kwa mazi.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Naho Yohana nakalonga uwona kugamba, “Nehimuona Muye ywa Mnungu akaseela kulawa kwe mbingu enga suwa, no kukima mwa Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Naho miye hyammanyize, mna yudya aniletile miye nibatize want'hu kwa mazi nie anigambile, ‘Yudya ukuunga unamuwone Muye akaseela na kumkima hamwenga na kwikala mwakwe, uyo niye akubatiza kwa Muye ywa Mnungu.’ ” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yohana na kagamba, “Miye mwenye hiona naho nalonga uwona kugamba uyu niye Mwana Mnungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Wana mp'hina wa nk'hongo wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Zuwa ditimile Yohana andaga kakimala naho hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe waidi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yohana naakamkaula Yesu umwo andile akagenda niyo agamba, “Kaula uyu nuyo Mwanangoto ywa Mnungu.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wadya wanamp'hina wakwe waidi weze weve ivo alongile, niyo wamtimila Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu niyo ahituka no kuwaona wamtimila, niyo awagamba, “Mwaungai?” Niyo wamgamba, “Labi, nuko kugamba mhinizi wekalahi?” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Niyo awahitula, “Soni mkaule.” Niyo waita, nokuhaona hadya akwikala niyo wasindanya naye msi wose, naho neinda yabula saa mlongo nekisingi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Anduleya nduguye dya Simoni Petulo andaga yumwenga ywa wadya waidi wamwivile Yohana niyo wamtimila Yesu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bosi, niyo Anduleya amzungula mkuluwe Simoni niyo amgamba, “Kimuona Masiha.” Uyo niye Kilisito Mlokozi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Niyo amwigala kwa Yesu. Yesu niyo amkaula no kummgamba, “Weye niwe Simoni Mwana Yohana. Weye nowitangwe Kefa.” Nuko kugamba kwa Kigiliki, Petulo hegu “iwe”.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awetanga Filipo hamwenga na Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Zuwa ditimile Yesu aonaga vedi aite Galilaya, kudya ambwiilaga Filipo niyo amgamba, “Nitimile.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Filipo andaga mkaya ywa Betisaida, mzi ukwo wakwikala Anduleya hamwenga na Petulo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Filipo niyo ambwiila Natanaeli niyo amgamba, “Kimuona yudya Musa alongaga zimbuli zakwe mwe miko naho walotezi nao nawawandika zimbuli zakwe, Yesu Mwana Yusufu mnt'hu wa Nazaleti.” <verse number="46" style="v"/>Natanaeli niyo auza, “Kint'hu chedi chadahika ivivihi kulawa Nazaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p">Filipo naye niyo amgamba, “Soo ukaule,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu eze amuone Natanaeli eza kwakwe amgambaga, “Kauleni Muizilaeli we kindedi heina nyambi yoyose.” <verse number="48" style="v"/>Natanaeli niyo amuuza Yesu, “Weye kunimanya vivihi?” Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nehikuona hasi yo mtini umwo Filipo andile akei kukwitanga.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Natanaeli niyo amhitula, “Mhinizi, weye Mwana Mnungu, Seuta ywa Izilaeli.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kwaviya nehikugamba hikuona hasi ho mtini, nivo vilekile ukahuwila? Nouone mbuli nk'hulu zikujink'ha izi.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Niyo amgamba, “nawagambilani ikindedi, namuwone ulanga ugubuke, watumigwa wa kwe mbingu wa Mnungu wakakwela na kuseela mwo Mwana Mnt'hu.”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahitula mazi kunda divai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Zuwa dya katatu niyo kwanda na ndoza uko Galilaya ko mzi ukwitangwa Kana, nine dya Yesu naye andaga uuko. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe nawalalikwa mwe indoza iyo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Divai ize isile nine dya Yesu niyo amgamba, “Divai yawe isila.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba nine, “Mnala, kina mbwai miye na weye? Isa yangu ikei kubula.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nine niyo awagamba wandima, “Dyodyose akuunga awagambileni, damanyeni.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kwandaga na mabiga mtandatu yakuikila mazi ye kuhaka kuligana na vihendo va Kiyahudi, yadamanywe kwa maiwe, kila dimwenga dikudaha kumema madumu ya mazi yakubula mtandatu kubula mfungate. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Memezeni mabiga mazi.” Niyo woho nao wayamemeza mazi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Niyo awagamba, “Tekeni amazi mmwigaile seuta,” Niyo watenda ivo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yudya seuta eze ayalume yadya mazi yahituke divai naho hamanyize uko ilaile mna wandima nawamanya, wadya wayatahile yadya mazi Yudya seuta niyo amwitanga yudya mlombi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>niyo amgamba, “Want'hu wose wakaga lumwe divai yedi, wakajika ukunywa idya iyedi niho wegale idya iihile, weye kuika divai yedi kubula ivi haluse.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Vilagiso ivi va nk'hongo, Yesu avidamanyaga uko Kana ya Galilaya vileke aulavanye uwedi wakwe utendese. Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamhuwila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aikukiza Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:12-13; Maliko 11:15-17; Luka 19:45-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Akajika, Yesu na nine na wanduguze, hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe, waitaga Kapelinaumu niyo wekala uko mazuwa mageke.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:12-13; Maliko 11:15-17; Luka 19:45-46</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Wila wa Wayahudi we Pasaka nounda uhagihi, Yesu niyo akwela kuita Yelusalemu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mwe nyumba ya Mnungu niyo aona want'hu wakutaga, ng'ombe, ngoto hamwenga na suwa manga. Naho no kunda na watuhu wakusakanya matundu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:14">Mnt'hu akusakanya matundu</figure> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Niyo aluka kube no kudifundika fundo, no kukonga kuwagulusa kwa kuwatoa wose wandile mwe nyumba ya Mnungu, hamwenga na magoto ne zing'ombe na wadya wandile wakasakanya matundu, niyo ayetila matundu yawe hamwenga nakuzikindula zimeza zawe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Niyo awagamba wadya nawakataga suwa manga, “Yafosezeni aya, msekuitenda nyumba ya Tate kunda hant'hu ha uchuuzi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wakumbukila ivo iwandikwe, “Neningilwe ni finju ye nyumba yako.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wamgamba, “Iki ni kilagiso chani kwa aya ukudamanya?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Imoleni Inyumba ino ya Mnungu, miye neni izenge mwa mazuwa matatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wadya wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Nyumba ino ya Mnungu neizengigwa kwa myaka milongo mine na mtandatu, mna weye wagamba nouizenge kwa mazuwa matatu du?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mna inyumba ya Mnungu andile akaisimuila nu umwili wakwe. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aho eze auyuke wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wakumbukila viya alongaga. Niyo wayahuwila mawandiko ya Mnungu hamwenga na ivo alongaga Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kaimanya mioyo ya want'hu wose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Umwo andile Yelusalemu mwo we Pasaka want'hu wengi wahuwilaga dizina dyakwe kwaviya wavionaga vilagiso vingi andaga akavidamanya. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mna Yesu hakehuwilise kwakwe kwaviya nakawamanya wose. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hakwaungigwe mnt'hu yeyose ywa kumlongela zimbuli zawe kwaviya yehe mwenye amanyaga zimbuli zi mwe mioyo yawe.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Nikodemo amtalamkila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Handaga na mnt'hu yumwenga ywa Mafalisayo zina dyakwe etangwagwa Nikodemo naho andaga kilongozi wa Wayahudi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Amwizilaga Yesu kilo kimwenga niyo amgamba, “Labi, kikumanya weye u mhinizi wizile kulawa kwa Mnungu, kwaviya hahali mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kudamanya vihungi ukudamanya weye uneva Mnungu hehamwenga nayehe.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nakugambila ikindedi, mnt'hu hanelekwe kaidi hakudaha kuuona Useuta wa Mnungu.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nikodemo niyo amgamba, “Yadahika vivihi mnt'hu kwelekwa kaidi uneva kadalahala kale? Neidahike vivihi kwingila mwe inda ya nine niyo elekwa kaidi?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nakugambila ikindedi mnt'hu hanelekwe kwa mazi na kwa Muye Msuntila, hakudaha kwingila ko Useuta wa Mnungu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mwili weleka mwili mna Muye weleka Muye. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Usekwehelwa kwa mbuli iyo hugambile kwaviya yaungigwa welekwe malavo ya kaidi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Muye yavuma ivo ikuunga naho mvumilo wakwe wevika mnaalo hukumanya uko ikulawa na uko ikuita naho ni ivo akuunga mnt'hu elekwe ni Muye Msuntila.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nikodemo niyo amhitula Yesu kugamba, “Mbuli izi zadahika ivivihi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Weye umhinizi wa Izilaeli mna zimbuli izi hukuzimanya? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nakugambila kindedia, ‘Diya kikudimanya chadilonga, na diya kidione chadilongela uwona, mna uwona wetu hamkuuzumila.’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Uneva himigambilani mbuli za mwe isi mna hamhuwile, nomhuwile vivihi nnawagambilani mbuli za kwe mbingu? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Naho hahali mnt'hu akweile kwe mbingu, ila yehe ezile kulawa uko, uyo Mwana Mnt'hu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enga iviya Musa ainulaga inyoka idya ye shaba mnanga mwo mti kudya kwe nyika, niivo vili kwa Mwana Mnt'hu, naye neenulwe kulanga, <verse number="15" style="v"/>vileke kila yumwenga akumhuwila ande na ugima wa ulo na ulo mwa Yehe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaviya Mnungu nakawaungisa want'hu wa mwe isi niyo amwigala Mwanawe heena miyawe vileke kila yumwenga akumhuwila asekwaga mna ande no ugima wa ulo na ulo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kwaviya Mnungu hamletile Mwanawe mwe isi vileke awasengele want'hu wa mwe isi, mna keza vileke isi iyokolwe kwombokela yehe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Akumhuwila Mwana hakusengelwa, mna wose hewe kumhuwila wasengelwa kale, kwaviya hawadihuwile dizina dya Mwana Mnungu eli ikedu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Naho usengelo wenye nuuno, ung'azi nowiza mwe isi, want'hu niyo waungisa ziza no kuulemela ung'azi, kwaviya yadya udamanyi wawe nounda wiha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kila akudamanya yaihile aulemela ung'azi naho hakwiza kwo ung'azi kwaviya hakuunga yadya akudamanya yaoneke. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mna yeyose akudamanya yadya yakumwelela Mnungu eza kwo ung'azi vileke, yadya akudamanya yaoneke yadamanywa kwa kumwogoha Mnungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana Mbatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ize yajike iyo, Yesu hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe waitaga mwe isi ya Uyahudi, niyo asinda uuko hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe, akabatiza want'hu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohana naye andaga akabatiza kint'hu kukwitangwa Ainoni, hagihi na Salimu kwaviya nokunda na mazi mengi, want'hu niyo waita kwakwe vileke wakabatizwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ayo yalailaga umwo Yohana andaga akei kuvugailwa mwe divugailo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Niyo wahigana. Wanamp'hina wa Yohana Mbatizi hamwenga na Myahudi yumwenga mwe mbuli yo kukuka. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Waitaga kwa Yohana niyo wamgamba, “Mhinizi, yudya mwandanye hamwenga kudya ng'ambu yo mto Yolodani, Yudya walongaga zimbuli zakwe, abatiza naho want'hu wose waita kwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yohana niyo awahitula, “Hakudaha mnt'hu kuhokela kint'hu uneva henk'higwe kulawa kwa Mnungu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nyuwe wenye mwasimuila kugamba miye nehilonga, ‘miye hiyo Kilisito Mkombozi mna himlongoela yehe.’ <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mta mlombigwa niye Mlombi, mna mbwiyaye dyo mlombi akukin'ha no kumtegeleza, anda na kinyemi kikulu akeva diizwi dyo mlombi. Haluse! Ikinyemi changu kigenyela <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yehe aungwa kunda mkulu miye name ninde mdodo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ezile kulawa kwe mbingu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yehe akwiza kulawa kwe mbingu ni mkulu ywa yose. Yeyose alaile mwe isi ni wa mwe isi, naho alonga zimbuli za mwe isi. Yehe akwiza kulawa kulanga, ekulanga kwa mbuli zose. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yadya ayaone nakuyeva nayo akuyasimuila, naho hahali akuzumila yadya akulonga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yehe akuuzumila ulosi wakwe, kazumila kugamba, Mnungu ni mkindedi. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yehe asigiilwe ni Mnungu alonga mbuli za Mnungu, kwaviya kenk'higwa Muye ywa Mnungu haheina kihimo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Tate amuungisa Mwanawe naho kamwink'ha vose mwe mikono yakwe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Akumzumila Umwana naande no ugima wa ulo na ulo. Mnt'hu akumlemela Umwana hana ugima, naho naande mwe masulumizo ya Mnungu.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga na Mvele we Kisamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mafalisayo na weva kugamba Yesu andaga na wanamp'hina wengi hamwenga nakubatiza kujink'ha Yohana. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ikindedi Yesu yemwenye habatize want'hu, mna wanamp'hina wakwe nao nawakabatiza want'hu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ivo Yesu eze eve ivo nawakalonga alawa Yudeya no kuuya naho Galilaya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naho nevimuunga ombokele Samalia. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Niyo abula kwo mzi wa Samalia ukwitangwa Sikali, hagihi na udya mgunda wa Yakobo amwink'haga Mwanawe Yusufu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hadya handile ne disima dya Yakobo, kwaviya Yesu na kanda kasokela kwajili ye nt'hambo yakwe, niyo ekala hagihi ne disima. Naho ne inda nomsi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Niyo heza mvele we Kisamalia aungaga ateke mazi. Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nink'he mazi ninywe.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe nawaitaga kwo mzi wakagule nk'hande. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yudya mvele we Kisamalia niyo amgamba Yesu, “Inda vivihi weye Myahudi unilombeze miye mvele we Kisamalia amazi yo ukunywa?” Kwaviya Wayahudi na Wasamalia hawakuhangana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Wamanyize uwedi ya Mnungu, naho ni ani akukulombeza mazi yo ukunywa, hegu nawe waungile no kumlombeza, heye amazi, hegu nakakwink'ha mazi yo ugima.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, weye huna kint'hu cho kutekela mazi sima nadyo tali, haluse kulavahi amazi ayo yo ugima? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Haluse weye umkulu kujink'ha Tati yetu Yakobo akink'hile idisima idi, niyo yehe mwenye anywa amazi ye disima idi hamwenga na wanawe hamwenga ne mifugwa yakwe yose?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Akunywa amazi aya naaone nk'hilu naho, <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mna mnt'hu akuunga anywe mazi aya yo ugima huunga nimwink'he, heeze aone nk'ilu naho, yadya mazi yo ugima huunga nimwink'he nayatende nchoko za mazi yo ugima zikubwiluka mndani mwakwe, no kwink'hiza ugima wa ulo na ulo.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Zumbe nink'he miye mazi ayo nise kunda nk'hilu naho, nisekwiza naho ha vileke niteke mazi.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Ita ukamwitange Mgosio wize naye aha!” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yudya Mvele niyo amhitula, “Hina mgosi.” Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kulonga vedi, ‘Hina mgosi.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kwaviya no kunda na wagosi washano, naho yudya unanaye ivi haluse hiyo ywako, aho kulonga kindedi.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, naona weye umlotezi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wakale wetu wavikaga mwo lugulu ulu na nyuwe mwagamba hant'hu hawagilwe kumvika Mnungu ni Yelusalemu.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Mvele unihuwile, isa yeza, naho homumvike Tate mwo lugulu ulu, hegu kudya Yelusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nyuwe mwavikila hemkummanya, suwe chavikila kimmanyize, Kwaviya ukombola walawa kwa Wayahudi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mna isa yeza naho ibula, wadya wakuvika kindedi nawamvikile Tate mwe kindedi mwe mioyo. Kwaviya Tate awazungula want'hu enga awo wakumvika. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mnungu ni Muye woho nao wakumvika waungwa wamvike mwe mioyo yawe na kwa kindedi.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yudya mvele niyo amgamba, “Himanya neeze Masiha akwitangwa Kilisito, uyo aneza naakigambile kila kint'hu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Miye hulonga na weye nu uuyo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Aaho wanamp'hina wakwe wauyaga mna weheelagwa kwaviya Yesu andaga akalonga na mvele, mna hakwandaga na yeyose amuuzile kugamba “Waungai?” Hegu nii walonga naye? <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yudya mvele niyo aleka idibiga dyakwe, nokuita kwo mzi niyo awagamba want'hu, <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Soni mkaule mnt'hu anigambile mbuli zangu zose nidamanye, mafani uyu niye Kilisito.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Niyo wahalawa kwo mzi na kuita kudya eli Yesu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Umwo wandile woho wenye, wanamp'hina wakwe wamhembelezaga wakamgamba Mhinizi dya nk'hande. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Niyo awagamba, “Miye nnanayo nk'hande hemkuimanya.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wauzana woho wenye, “Haluse eyuko mnt'hu amwigaile nk'hande?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ikande yangu ni ino,” nidamanye yadya “akuunga yudya aniletile niibindilize indima yakwe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nyuwe hamkulongaga isigala miezi mine vileke kibule mwo uvuni? Mna miye nawagambilani, inuleni meso yenyu mkaule migunda, iikwa lumwe kwa kuvuna. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na yudya akuvuna ahokela maliho hamwenga na kukisanya matunda kwa mbuli yo ugima wa ulo na ulo, vileke yudya akuhanda na yudya akuvuna welelwe hamwenga. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kwaviya aho elo ulosi watenda kindedi kugamba, yumwenga ahanda na mtuhu avuna. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Miye nehiwasigiila mkavune yadya hamyadamanyile ndima, watuhu nawadamanya ndima, nanywe mwengila mwe ndima.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Wasamalia wengi wo mzi udya, niyo wamhuwila kwa yadya alongile yudya mvele kugamba, “Kanigambila zimbuli zangu zose nidamanye.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Niyo wadya wasamalia weze waite kwakwe, nawamhembelezesa vileke ekale kwawe. Yehe naye niyo ekala kwawe mazuwa maidi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Want'hu wengi vitendese, niyo wahuwila kwa mbuli ya udya ulosi wakwe. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Niyo wamgamba yudya mvele, “Haluseelo kihuwila naho hiyo kwa yadya ulongile du, mna kiiva suwe wenye naho chamanya ikindedi mnt'hu uyu nie mlokozi ywe Isi.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yeze yajike mazuwa maidi niyo ahalawa kudya no kuita Galilaya. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Kwaviya Yesu ye mwenye nakalonga uwona kugamba, mlotezi hakutologwa kwawe, mwe Isi yakwe ye mwenye. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Viya eze abule Galilaya wadya want'hu wa Galilaya niyo wamhokela Kwaviya nawaziona mbuli zose Yesu adamanye kudya Yelusalemu mwe wila, Kwaviya wadya nao nawaita kwe wila. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Niyo abula vituhu mo Mzi wa Kana wandile Galilaya hadya ahitule amazi kunda divai. Nahanda na mkulu yumwenga wa selikali, Mwanawe na kanda mnyonge uko Kapelinaumu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Uyo eze eve Yesu keza kulawa Uyahudi mpaka Galilaya niyo aita kwake, amlombezaga vileke asele, aite akamhonye Mwanawe ywa kibwanga, kwaviya na kanda hagihi na kubanika. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Haheina kuwona kilagiso na vihungi, hamkudaha kuhuwila.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yudya mkulu wa selekali niyo amgamba, “Zumbe hakeseleza seka Mwanangu anabanike.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Keitile, mwanao mgima!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yudya mt'hu niyo ahuwila viya Yesu amlongile niyo atimila sila no kuita kwake. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Viya ndile akei mwe sila, wandima wakwe niyo wambwila na mbuli kugamba, “mwanawe kahona kale udya unyonge!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Eze awauze umuda mwanawe ahonile niyo wamgamba, “Unyonge umleka gulo msi wa saa mfungate.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Aaho ise niyo amanya umuda ni udya agambilwe na Yesu, “Mwanao, mgima kahona”. Niyo ahuwila yehe hamwenga na wose wandile mwe nyumba yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Icho ni kilagiso cha kaidi adamanye Yesu viya alaile Uyahudi kubula Galilaya.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mnt'hu hagihi ne dikawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Niyo handa na zuwa dya kinyemi ya Wayahudi, Yesu nae niyo akwela kwita Yelusalemu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Naho Yelusalemu, hagihi ne nk'hili ikwitangwa nk'hili ya ngoto handaga na kawa dya mazi dikwitangwa kwa kiibulania Betisaza, naho nedinda na wazila washano wazunguluke wa kombokela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Naho wanyonge wengi, mant'hunt'hu, viwete na waholole, nawagona mwe ziya zisila zo kombokela. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nawakagoja mazi yatibulwe, Kwaviya hamwenga aha mtumwa ywa Mnungu naakeza he dikawa na kuyatibula amazi. Mnyonge ywa nk'hongo kwingila mwa mazi umwo mmazi yakanda yatibulwa naakahona unyonge wowose andile nao. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hadya nahanda na mnt'hu andile mnyonge kwa myaka milongo mitatu na mnane. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu eze amuone yudya agonile, amanyaga kugamba andaga iivo kwa lupisi lutali, niyo amuuza, “Waunga unde mgima?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yudya mnyonge niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, miye hina mnt'hu akuunga anigele mwe dikawa dya mazi viya mazi yanatibulwa, viya miye heza, kuna mnt'hu mtuhu akunilongoela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kimala ketwike kigonelo chako wiite.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ahadya yudya mnyonge niyo anda mgima, aketwika kigonelo chakwe na kugenda, naho zuwa diya nedinda dya kuhumula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wamgamba yudya ahonyigwe, “Dyelo ni zuwa dya kuhumula naho havikuungwa kwa weye kwinula ikigonelo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Niyo awahitula, “Yudya atendile miye ninde mgima niye anigambile niketwike ikigonelo nigende.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Niyo wamuuza, “Mnt'hu uyo akugambile uketwike wiite ni ani?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mna yudya mnt'hu ahonyigwe andaga hammanyize yudya amhonyile, Kwaviya hadya na handa na want'hu wengi Yesu andaga kahalawa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Niyo elo Yesu ambwiila Yudya mt'hu mwe nyumba yo kumvika Mnungu, Yesu niyo amgamba, “Kaula kunda mgima, usekudamanya wavu naho, dinase dikakubwiila buli tuhu diihile kujink'ha idi.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yudya mnt'hu niyo akeitila nokuwagambila vilongozi wa Wayahudi mnt'hu amhonyile ni Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kwaviya Yesu nakahonya mnt'hu mwe dizuwa dya kuhumula Wayahudi niyo wakonga kumsunk'hasunk'ha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Tate adamanya ndima mpaka ivi haluse, miye name nadamanya.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mwe zimbuli izo, vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo watendesa kuzungula sila yo kumkoma, naho hiyo du kwa mbuli ya kudamanya ndima mwe zuwa dya kuhumula, mna hamwenga na kumwitanga Mnungu ise mwenye, naho nakuketenda kaligana na Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Mwana wa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Ikindedi nawagambilani, Mwana hakudaha kudamanya ndima yoyose kwa udahi wakwe, mna idya amwuone Ise akadamanya Kwaviya yadya akudamanya Tate, naayo akuyadamanya Mwana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kwaviya Tate amuungisa Mwana naho amlagisa yose akudamanya yehe mwenye, naho naamlagise mbuli nk'hulu ikujink'ha izi, nanywe nomwehelwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Enga viya Tate akuuyula want'hu wabanike nakuwatenda wande wagima, iviya iviya Mwana naye awatenda wagima wadya akuwaunga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Naho Tate hakumsengela mnt'hu yeyose mna udahi wo usengelo kamwink'ha Mwana, <verse number="23" style="v"/>vileke want'hu wamwive Mwana enga viya wakumwogoha Tate amwigale Umwana. Mnt'hu heekumwogoha Mwana, hakumwogoha Tate amwigale Umwana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Namigambilani ikindedi, mnt'hu akuutegeleza ulosi wangu hamwenga nokumhuwila yudya aniletile ana ugima wa ulo na ulo, naho hakwingila mo usengelo mna na ande komboka kulawa ko file kengila ko ugima wa Mnungu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Namigambilani ikindedi, isa yeza, naho ibula, wadya wabanike naweve izwi dya Mwana wa Mnungu naho wadya wakunga weve nawande wagima. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Enga viya Tate kunda ni chotoko cho ugima, kwe sila iiyo kamtenda Umwana naye kunda chotoko cha ugima. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Naye niyo amwink'ha Umwana udahi wa kusengela, Kwaviya yehe ni Mwana wa Mnt'hu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Msekwehelwa, Kwaviya isa yeza want'hu wose wandile mwe vikuta naweve izwi dyakwe. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Naho nawauyuke, wadya watendile mbuli zedi kwa uuyulo wo ugima, na wadya watendile mbuli ziihile kwa uuyulo wo masulumizo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Hikudaha kudamanya mbuli kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye, nalamula enga viya Mnungu anilagize, naho usengelo wangu miye wa kindedi, Kwaviya hikuzungula yadya huunga miye mwenye mna ya yudya aniletile.</para>
  <para style="s">Ukindedi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Mbuli zangu nnazilonga miye mwenye, nezinde hiyo kindedi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mna eyuko mnt'hu akunilongela mbuli zangu, naho miye himanya mbuli ziya akunilongela ni za kindedi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nyuwe nomsigila want'hu kwa Yohana naye niyo alonga uwona we kindedi mwe zimbuli zangu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mna miye hikuhokela uwona uwo wakulonga want'hu, mna nalonga ivi vileke nyuwe myokolwe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yohana na kanda enga lumuli lukukwela kulangaza, naho nyuwe nomkeikila lumwe kuonela kinyemi ulumuli ulo kwa lupisi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mna uwona nnanawo miye ni mkulu kujink'ha udya wa Yohana Kwaviya zindima ziya anink'hile Tate nizidamanye zanilongela, naho zalagisa kugamba Tate niye anisigiile miye. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tate aniletile kalonga kale uwona mwa miye, nyuwe hamnati mmuwone ifuta yakwe, naho hata kwiva izwi dyakwe. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ulosi wakwe haumuli mwe mioyo yenyu, Kwaviya nyuwe hamkumhuwila yudya asigilwe ni Tate. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mwakaulisa yadya yawandikwe kwaviya mmanya mndani mwakwe umwo mna ugima wa ulo na ulo. Mawandiko wenye wanilongela miye. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hamkuunga kwiza kwangu vileke mnde na ugima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Hiyo kugamba nazungula kutogolwa kulawa kwa want'hu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mna hiwamanyani kugamba mwe mioyo yenyu hamna lukunde kwa Mnungu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Miye hiza kwa udahi wa Tate, mna nyuwe hamkunihokela, mna mtuhu aneza kwe dizina dyakwe yehe mwenye uyo nomumhokele. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nomdahe ivivihi kunihuwila nyuwe mkuhokela ukulu kulawa mwenyu, mna hamkuzungula ukulu kulawa kwa Mnungu? <verse number="45" style="v"/>Msekugamba neniwalongelezeni kwa Tate, eyuko akuwalongelezeni nyuwe, yehe ni Musa yudya nyuwe mkumkawiila. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Uneva mwamhuwile Musa, hegu nomnihuwila name Kwaviya yehe nakawandika zimbuli zangu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mnaalo Kwaviya hamyahuwile yadya awandike Musa, nomhuwile vivihi aya miye hulonga?”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu enk'ha nk'hande want'hu magana milongo mishano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo aita gundi ye bahali ye Galilaya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Fyo kulu dya want'hu niyo dyamtimila Kwaviya nawaviona vilagiso awadamanyile wanyonge. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu niyo akwela ko lugulu no kwikala uko na wanamp'hina wakwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wila wa wayahudi ye pasaka neinda ihagihi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu niyo enula meso yakwe, eze akaule niyo aona want'hu wengi wakumtimila, niyo amgamba Filipo, “Chakugulahi nk'hande ikuunga iweguse want'hu awa?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nakalonga viya vileke amgeze filipo, Kwaviya ye mwenye nakamanya diya akumgamba adamanye. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Filipo niyo amhitula, “Hata chandile na matundu yakubula dinali magana maidi, haya kudaha kugula mikate niyo kila yumwenga adye egute.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yumwenga wa wanamp'hina wakwe akwitangwa Anduleya mvunawe dya simoni Petulo, niyo agamba, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Kuna ndugu ywetu yumwenga anamikate mishano na samaki mbili. Mna ivi navikint'he mbwai mwa want'hu enga awa?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Wekazeni want'hu hasi”. Kwaviya na handa na mani mengi want'hu niyo wekala hasi, wagosi na wanda wabula elufu shano. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu niyo aguha idya mikate nakumtogola Mnungu niyo awenk'ha wadya want'hu wekale hasi hamwenga na viya visamaki viidi kila yumwenga viya vikumkint'ha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Want'hu wose weze wegute niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Kisanyeni wabesu wasigale kusekwaga kabesu kokose.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Niyo waduganya awabesu wadya no kumemeza nt'hangulu mlongo na mbili.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Want'hu weze waone vilagiso viya adamanye Yesu, niyo wagamba, “Ikindedi uyuo ni yudya mlotezi chandile kikagoja.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu eze amanye nawakaunga kumtozeleza vileke ande Zumbe wawe, niyo ahalawa ikedu nokuita kwo lugulu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu agenda mnanga mwa mazi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 14:22-33; Maliko 6:45-52</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ize ibuze nekisingi wanamp'hina wakwe niyo waseleza kuita kwe diziwa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Niyo wengila kwe ngalawa no kukonga kujink'hanya kuita Kapelinaumu, umuda uo kaziza nakakonga kwingila, Yesu nae na kanda akei kulaila. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lupisi uo heho kulu nedikavumila, ibahali nayo neikonga kuhilukila. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wana mp'hina wakwe weze wagambigwe wagendalugendo ukubula maili mnane, niyo wamuona Yesu agenda mnanga mwa mazina ehagihi ne ngalawa, wogohesa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ni miye msekogoha.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Niyo wanda na kinyemi kikulu no kumhokela mwe ingalawa, lupisi ulo niyo wanda wabula kudya wandile wakaita.</para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu wamzungula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Zuwa dya kaidi wadya want'hu wekale nt'hendelo idya ya kaidi nawaona kugamba handaga na ngalawa imwenga du, naho Yesu na kanda haitile na wanamp'hina wakwe, awanamp'hina wakwe nawahalawa woho wenye. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mna zimashua nt'huhu kulawa Tibelia nazinda hagihi nakubula hadya hant'hu wadile imikate viya Yesu eze amtogola Mnungu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wadya want'hu weze wabunk'hule Yesu na kanda hahali hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wengila mwe zia zingalawa na kwiita Kapelinaumu kumzungula.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye mkate wo ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Weze wambwile Yesu gundi ye diziwa niyo wamuuza, “Mhinizi, kubula ini uku?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe hamkunizungula kwaviya vilagiso hamwenga na vilagiso viya hudamanya, mna mwanizungula kwaviya no mdya imikate niyo mweguta. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Msekuidamanyila ndima nk'hande ikubanika mna damanyileni ndima nk'hande heikusila, nk'hande yo ugima wa ulo na ulo ink'hande iyo nomwink'higwe ni Mwana wa Mnt'hu naho Tate Mnungu ye mwenye kalagisa kugamba, kamsagula na kumzumila.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Niyo wamuuza, “Haluse kitende vivihi vileke kidahe kudamanya viya Mnungu akuunga kidamanye?” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Kiya mkuungwa ni Mnungu mdamanye ni kugamba, mumhuwile yudya asigilwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Niyo wamgamba, “Noudamanye kilagiso chani kikione vileke kikuhuwile? Noudamanye kint'hu chani? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wakale wetu, nawadya nk'hande ikwitangwa mana mwe nyika enga yadya yawandikwe yakulonga, ‘Nakawenk'ha mikate kulawa kwa Mnungu niyo wadya.’ ” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nawagambileni ikindedi, hiyo Musa awenk'heni imikate kulawa kwo ulanga Tate niye awenk'heni mkate we kindedi kulawa kwo ulanga. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwaviya mkate wa Mnungu ni yudya aseele kulawa kwa Mnungu na yehe niye akwink'hiza ugima want'hu wa mwe Isi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Niyo wamgamba, “Zumbe, kink'he iyo nk'hande mazuwa yose.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Miye niye nk'hande ikwink'hiza ugima, mnt'hu akwiza kwangu haaone sala naho, naho yudya akunihuwila haaone nk'hilu naho. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mna himigambilani, mwaniyona mna mkei hamkuunga kunihuwila. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wadya wose Tate anink'hile naweze kwangu naho yudya akwiza kwangu henimduule kuse. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kwaviya hizile kulawa kwa Mnungu vileke nidamanye yadya huunga miye, mna hiza vileke nidamanye yadya akuunga yudya akisigiile. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Viya akuunga yudya akisigiile ni ivi, ‘Nisekumwaza hata yumwenga mwe wadya anink'hile mna vileke niwauyule wose mwe dizuwa diya dyo uheelo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kwaviya mbuli akuunga Tate ni ino, wose wamuwone umwana no kumhuwila wande na ugima wa ulo na ulo name neniwauyule mwe dizuwa dyo uheelo.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wakonga kun'gung'uzika Kwaviya naakagamba, “Miye ni mkate nizile kulawa kulanga kwa Mnungu.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Niyo wauza, “Uyo hiyo Yesu mwana ywa Yusufu? Naho ise na nine hikugamba kiwamanya? Haluse ni mbwai akigamba kaseela kulawa kwa Mnungu?” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mse kungunguzika, <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hahali mnt'hu akudaha kwiza kwangu uneva Tate anitumile miye hamletile kwangu, name nenimuuyule mwe zuwa dyo uheelo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Enga walotezi wa Mnungu viya wawandike, ‘Wose nawahinizwa na Mnungu.’ Yehe akumtegeleza Tate hamwenga na kuhina kulawa kwakwe, neeze kwangu. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Uko nuko kugamba hakuna mnt'hu amuone Tate, mna ni yudya alaile kwa Mnungu, nie amuone kale Tate. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Namigambilani ikindedi, akunihuwila ananao ugima wa ulo na ulo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Miye niye nk'hande yo ugima, <verse number="49" style="v"/>Tati zenu na wadya mana kwe dijangwa mna niyo wabanika. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mna aha hana nk'hande ilaile kwa Mnungu, naho mnt'hu yeyose anadya haabanike, <verse number="51" style="v"/>Miye niyo ink'hande ilaile kwa Mnungu, Mnt'hu yeyose anadya iyo ink'hande neekale ulo na ulo. Naho nk'hande yenye niino, umwili wangu huunga niulave vileke want'hu wose mwe isi wande na ugima.” <verse number="52" style="v"/>Aho wayahudi niyo wakonga kuhigana wenye kwa wenye wakauzana, “Mnt'hu uyu adaha vivihi kukink'ha suwe umwili wakwe kiudye?” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Namigambilani ikindedi, hamna udile umwili wakwe Mwana wa Adamu hamwenga na kuinywa isakame yakwe, hamkudaha kunda na ugima mndani mwenyu.” <verse number="54" style="v"/>Wadya wakuudya umwili wangu hamwenga na kuinywa isakame yangu wananao ugima wa ulo na ulo. Naho miye neniwauyule mwe dizuwa dyo uheelo. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Kwaviya umwili wangu niyo nk'hande ye kindedi na isakame yangu nicho cho ukunywa che kindedi. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Wakuudya umwili wangu nakuinywa isakame yangu wekala mndani mwangu name nekala mndani mwawe. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Tate emgima kanisigila miye, miye name ni mgima kwa Tate, Ivi yudya akuunga anidye naende mgima umwangu. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Ino niyo ink'hande ikuseela kulawa kwa Mnungu hiyo enga viya Tati zenyu wadile idya nk'hande niyo wafa, mna akuunga adye ino nk'hande naande mgima ulo na ulo. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Mbuli izi nakazilonga mwe nyumba yo kuvikila uko Kapelinaumu.</para>
  <para style="s">Mahinizo yo ugima houkusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe wengi weze weve mabilikizi yakwe niyo wagamba, “Mabilikizi yakwe ni madala, akuunga ayatongele ni ani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Mwe umoyo wakwe Yesu niyo abunk'hula kugamba, wanamp'hina wakwe wangunguzika mwe yadya alongile, niyo awagamba, “Haluse ulosi uno umilumizani mwe mioyo? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Haluse neinde vivihi mkamuona Mwana wa Adamu akwela akaita kudya alawaga? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Kikugela ugima ni Muye ywa Mnungu, mnt'hu hana udahi wowose. Mbuli nimigambileni nuwo ugima, na Muye ywa Mnungu. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Mna mwa nyuwe kuna watuhu wakei kuhuwila” Yesu na kanda kamanya kukongela aho nk'hongo yudya hehuwile hamwenga na yudya akuunga amsenge. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Niyo agendeela ukulonga, “Ivo nivo vilekile hamigambilani, hahali mnt'hu akudaha kwiza kwangu uneva Tate haungile.” <verse number="66" style="v"/>Mbuli iyo niiyo ilekile wengi mwa wanamp'hina wakwe wauye kunyuma waleke kumtimila. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba wadya mlongo na waidi, “Togoleni nyuwe nanywe mwaunga mhalawe?” <verse number="68" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe kiite kwaani? Weye una mbuli zo ugima wa ulo na ulo. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Suwe kikuhuwila naho kibunk'hula kugamba weye niwe msuntilwa ywa Mnungu.” <verse number="70" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Togoleni, miye himisaguleni nyuwe mlongo na waidi mna yumwenga ywenyu ni Mwavu?” <verse number="71" style="v"/>Naakalonga Yuda mwana ywa Simoni Isikaliyote. Yehe na kanda yumwenga mwa wanamp'hina wa Yesu mna niye andile nakaunga amsezenge.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu na wanduguze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Akajika Yesu andaga akagenda uko Galilaya, andaga hakuunga akomboka mwo Uyahudi kwaviya Wayahudi nawanda wakamzungula vileke wamkome. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Naho dizuwa dya kinyemi dya Wayahudi dye viheha nedinda dihagihi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nduguze niyo wamgamba, “Halawe aha uite Uyahudi, vileke wanamp'hina wako wakaule zindima zako ukudamanya.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kwaviya hahali mnt'hu akuunga adamanye zindima kwa kinyele, mna ye mwenye aunga amanyike. Kwaviya weye wadamanya izimbuli izi, leka want'hu wose wa mwe Isi wakumanye. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kwaviya hata wanduguze na wanda hawakumhuwila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Lupisi lwangu ukei kubula, kila lupisi niwedi kwenyu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Want'hu wa mwe isi hawakudaha kumiihieni, mna waniihia miye, Kwaviya miye nalonga uwona mwa yehe kugamba udamanyi wakwe wiha. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nyuwe iteni kwe wila mna miye nikei Kwaviya umuda wangu ukei kubula.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu nakalonga ivi niyo asigala ukudya Galilaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mwe zuwa dya kinyemi ye vikumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nduguze weze waite kwe wila Yesu nae niyo aita, Mna nakaita kwa kifiso vileke asekuoneka. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Wakulu wa wayahudi nawakamzungula kudya kwe wila wakauzana, “E kuhi uyu?” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Want'hu wengi na wanda mwe vibungi wakasimuila zi mbuli zakwe. Wamwenga nawakagamba, “uyuno ni mnt'hu ywedi.” Awatuhu nao niyo wagamba, “Hiyo mnt'hu ywedi Kwaviya awazaganya want'hu.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mna hahali mnt'hu alongile mwe kieti Kwaviya nawaka wogoha wayahudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mgati mwe wila Yesu niyo akwela no kwingila mwe nyumba ya Mnungu no kukonga kuhiniza. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wehelwa wakagamba, “Uyu kalavai umanyi wa aya yose nae hasomile heusomile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Yano huhiniza hiyo mahinyo yangu, mna lawa kwa Tate aniletile miye. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mnt'hu akuunga adamanye zimbuli ziya Mnungu akuunga, naamanye uneva aya huhiniza yalawa kwa Mnungu hegu ni yangu miye mwenye. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mnt'hu akukelongela ye mwenye aunga akeink'he uwedi utendese ye mwenye. Mna yudya akuunga amwinule yudya amletile uyu niwakindedi naho hauhali wiihi mndani mwakwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Musa hawenk'heni miko? Mna hahali hata yumwenga mwa nyuwe azitozile. Nii mwaunga mnikome miye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Idifyo diya dya want'hu niyo dyamhitula, “Una mp'hepo! Uyo akuunga akukome weye ni ani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nehidamanya kihungi nyuwe nyose niyo mwehelwa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Musa nakawasigila muwavinile wana wenyu wa kigosi Mna neinda hiyo Musa aungile na wanda Tati zenyu walongole naho mwavinila wana mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Uneva mwana wa kigosi kavinilwa mwe dizuwa dya kuhumula, vileke miko ya Musa isekubanangwa, nii mwanifila maya Kwaviya nitendile mnt'hu ande mgima mwe zuwa dyo kuhumula? <verse number="24" style="v"/>Msekulava usengelo kwa kukaula kwa kuse mna laveni usengelo kwa kukaula ikindedi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye Kilisito?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Want'hu watuhu we Yelusalemu niyo wagamba, “Yuno hiyo yudya mnt'hu wakunga wamkome? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kauleni alonga mwe kiyeti mna hawakulonga dyodyose. Togoleni, vilongozi wamanya ikindedi kugamba yuno niye Kilisito? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mna Kilisito aneza hahali mnt'hu akuunga amanye uko alaile. Mna suwe chose kimanya kudya akulawa yuno mnt'hu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu eze enda ahiniza mwe nyumba ya Mnungu niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Icho nk'hindedi kugamba mnimanya miye, na kudya nilaile. Hizile kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye. Yudya anigale miye, yehe ni mkindedi, mna hamummanyize. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mna miye himmanya Kwaviya hiza kulawa kwakwe naho yehe niye aniletile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Niyo wageza kumgwila, mna hahali hata yumwenga amtozile Kwaviya umuda wakwe nawanda ukei. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Niyo want'hu wengi mwe difyo diya wamhuwila na kulonga, “Aho aneza Kilisito, naadamanye vilagiso vingi enga ivi adamanye yuno?”</para>
  <para style="s">Asikali wasigilwa wakamgwile Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mafalisayo niyo weva viya want'hu wakungungula mwe mbuli izi za Yesu, niyo woho hamwenga ne wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wasigila wamizi we nyumba ya Mnungu uleke waite wakamgwile Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu niyo alonga, “Usigala lupisi mdodo wa kunda na nyuwe, nikakuheza neniite zangu kwa yudya aniletile. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Namunzungule mna hamnione, kwaviya hamkudaha kwiita kudya huunga ninde.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Niyo wayahudi wauzana, “Ni kuhi uko aite, uko hekimuwone? Haluse aunga aite kwe mizi ye Wagiliki kudya want'hu wetu wakwikala nakuwahiniza Wagiliki? <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nivo naakagaaze umwo akagamba, nomnizungule mna hamnione naho homdahe kwiita kudya huunga niite?”</para>
  <para style="s">Vizuto va mazi ya ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mwe zuwa dya uheelo, zuwa diya kulu mwe zuwa dya kinyemi, Yesu niyo akimaala alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Mnt'hu yudya ane nk'hilu eze kwangu anywe. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Enga viya iwandikwe, ‘Yudya akunihuwila, vizuto va mazi yo ugima navilawe kulawa mndani mwakwe.’ ” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu nakalonga ivi kwa mbuli ye Muye ywa Mnungu, yudya wadya wakumhuwila nawamhokele. Mwe lupisi kiya Muye na kanda akei kwiza kwaviya Yesu na kanda akei kutogoleswa ni Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuchakukana kwa want'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Want'hu wamwenga naweva viya alongile niyo walonga, “Mnt'hu uyu, kindedi ni Mlotezi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Want'hu watuhu niyo wagamba, “Uyu ni Kilisito!” Mna watuhu niyo wagamba, “Vyadahika Kilisito kulawa Galilaya? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mawandiko wakigambila, Kilisito naalaile mwo lukolo lwa Zumbe Daudi naho neelekigwe Betelehemu mzi ekalaga Daudi.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Niyo handa na kupangana kwa want'hu kwa mbuli yakwe Yesu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Watuhu nawakaunga kumgwila, mna hahali amtozile.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuswesa kuhuwila kwa Vilongozi wa Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Wadya wamizi wa nyumba ya Mnungu wasigilwe weze wauye, wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo niyo wawauza, “Nii hammwigale?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Wadya wamizi wa Nyumba ya Mnungu niyo wahitula, “Hahalailaga hata mnt'hu yumwenga akulonga enga mnt'hu uyu!” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mafalisayo niyo wawauza, “Hata nyuwe mwazaganywa?” <verse number="48" style="v"/>“Nyuwe mummanya yeyeso mwe Vilongozi hegu mwe Mafalisayo akumhuwila yehe? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Want'hu wano hawamanyize miko ya Musa, waligitwa ni Mnungu!” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mwe wadya mafalisayo, Nikodemo andagaaho, yudya aitaga kwa Yesu, niyo awagambila weyawe, <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Mwe miko ya kwetu hakikudaha kumsengela mnt'hu uneva kikei kumtegeleza na kumanya idyo adamanye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Niyo wamhitula, “Weye nawe kulaila Galilaya? Kaula mo Mawandiko Akukile naho nauone hahali mlotezi ezile kulawa Galilaya.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Niyo kila yumwenga aita kwakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mvele agwiligwe kwo uhabwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo aita ko Mnima lwe Mizeituni. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mtootondo, niyo auya naho kwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. Want'hu wose wamzungulukaga niyo yehe ekala hasi no kukonga kuwahiniza. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wahinizi we miko hamwenga na Mafalisayo niyo wamwigaila mvele agwiligwe akadamanya uhambwasi, niyo wamkimalisa hameso ya want'hu wose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niyo wamgamba Yesu, “Mhinizi, mvele uyu kagwiligwa akadamanya uhabwasi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mwe miko yetu Musa kakigamba, mvele enga uyu aungigwa atoigwe maiwe mpaka abanike. Weye wagaaze?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nawalonga ivi kumtegela Yesu vileke wamlongeleze. Mna yehe niyo afunamaga hasi niya akonga kuwandika hasi na kadole kakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Weze wande wakagendeela kumuuza maswali, Yesu akimaalaga nakuwagamba, “Mnt'hu yeyose mwenyu heena wavu ande ywa nk'hongo kumduila iwe.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Niyo afunama naho nakuwandika hasi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Weze weve ivi, wose niyo wahalawa, yumwe yumwe wakakongela wadala vilongozi. Yesu niyo asigala ekedu na yudya mvele endile akei kakimala. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu niyo akimaala, amgamba yudya mvele, “Wekuhi? Hasigale hata yumwenga akukulongeleza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yudya mvele niyo amhitula, “Zumbe hawahali.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo agamba, “Vedi. Hata miye hikukusengela keitile, mna unasekudamanya wavu naho.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ung'azi we isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu niyo alonga vituhu na Mafalisayo, “Miye niye ung'azi we isi.” Niyo agendeela, “Yudya akunitimila na ande na ung'azi wa ugima naho haagendele mwo lwiza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mafalisayo niyo wamgamba, “Weye walava uwona wako mwenye, na izo ukukelongela uwona hiyo za kindedi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Hata nnakelongela uwona mbuli idya hukelongela ni kindedi, Kwaviya himanya kudya hulawa na kudya huita. Nyuwe hammanyize kudya hulawa hamwenga na kudya huita. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nyuwe mwasengela kimnt'humnt'hu, miye himsengele mnt'hu yeyose. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mna uneva nnadamanya ivo, usengelo wangu nounde wakindedi. Kwaviya miye hikedu, Tate yudya anigale e hamwenga na miye. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iwandikwa mwe miko yenyu kugamba, ‘Uneva want'hu waidi wanalava uwona ukuligana, icho wakulonga, ni kindedi.’ ” <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Nalonga uwona wa miye mwenye, Tate yangu nae anigale anilongela uwona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Niyo wamuuza, “Iso eihi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Hamnimanyize miye naho hamummanyize Tate. Mwanimanyize miye hata Tate hegu nomummanya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu nakalonga yose aya viya andile akahiniza mwe Nyumba ya Mnungu. Mwe chumba kikuikigwa ikindolo cha malavo Naho hahali hata yumwenga amgwiile Kwaviya umuda wakwe no unda ukei kubula.</para>
  <para style="s">Hamkudaha kuita kudya miye huita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu niyo alonga nao vituhu, “Nenihalawe nanywe nomnizungule, mna nomfe mwo wavu wenyu. Hamkudaha kuita kudya miye huita.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wagamba, “Agamba hakikudaha kuita kudya akuunga aite, haluse kigambe aunga akekome yehe mwenye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nyuwe ni wa aha he isi, mna miye hiza kulawa kulanga kwa Mnungu. Nyuwe mwalawa mwe isi ino mna miye hiyo wa ino isi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ivo nivo vilekile hamigambilani nomfe kwo wavu uwo mnanawo, naho nomfe mwo wavu wenyu uneva hamkuhuwila kugamba, ‘Miye ni Yehe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Niyo wamuuza, “Weye ni ani?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Idiya nawagambilani kukongela aho nk'hongo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nnanazo mbuli nyingi za kulonga mwa want'hu wose wamwe isi, na za kuwasengela nyuwe, yudya anigale miye yehe ni Mkindedi. Naho nawagambila want'hu diya nivile kulawa kwakwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hawabunk'hule kugamba Yesu nakawagambila mbuli ya Ise. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mnamwinula Mwana wa Mnt'hu nommanye, ‘Miye niye Yehe.’ Naho nommanye hikudamanya mbuli yoyose kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye, mna nalonga dia Tate anisigiile nnonge. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Naho yudya anigale miye e hamwenga na miye, hakunasa nikedu, Kwaviya nadamanya mbuli ziku mbwedeza.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Want'hu wengi wevile Yesu viya naakasimuila, niyo wamhuwila.</para>
  <para style="s">Mwana ywa Mnt'hu naawaikeni nyuwe vilekelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagambila wadya Wayahudi wakumhuwila, “Mnayazumila amahinizo yangu, nomnde wanamp'hina wangu kindedi, <verse number="32" style="v"/>naivo nommanye ikindedi, naho icho ikindedi, nekimiikeni vilekelwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Niyo wamhitula, “Suwe ni welekwa wa Ibulahimu, naho hakinati kinde watumwa wa mnt'hu yeyose. Nii ukagamba, ‘Nomnde walekelwa?’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Namigambilani ikindedi, kila mnt'hu akudamanya wavu ni mtumwa wo wavu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mtumwa hi mwana wa mwe kaya mazuwa yose, mna mwana mwelekwa yehe ni wa umudya mndani mazuwa yose. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Uneva Mwana anawatenda mnde vilekelwa, nomnde vilekelwa kindedi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hiwamanyani nyuwe ni cheleko che Ibulahimu, mna mwaunga mnikome, Kwaviya hamkuyaunga mahinyo yangu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nalonga diya Tate anilagise, mna nyuwe mwadamanya diya mgambilwe ni tati yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Niyo wamhitula, “Tati yetu ni Ibulahimu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo awahitula, “Uneva mwandile wana Ibulahimu, hegu mwadamanye zimbuli enga ziya adamanye. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yose nidamanye, nikumigambilani kindedi nivile kulawa kwa Mnungu mna mwaunga mnikome. Ibulahimu hadamanye mbuli enga izi! <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwadamanya mbuli enga ziya tati yenyu adamanye.”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamhitula, suwe hachelekwe mwo uhabwasi. “Kina Tate yetu yumwenga du niye Mnungu. Suwe naswe kiwana wakwe wa kindedi.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mnungu andile tati yenyu kindedi, hegu nomniunga kwaviya nalawa kwakwe naho hiza. Hizile miye mwenye mna yehe niye aniletile. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nii hamkukombaganya diya hulonga? Kwaviya hamkuunga kwiva ulosi wangu. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nyuwe wana wa tati yenyu Mwavu, naho mwaunngisa kuyatimila yadya tati yenyu akuyaunga. Kukongela nk'hongo na kanda mkomi, naho akei ande mwe kindedi, Kwaviya hamna ikindedi mndani mwakwe, kwaviya aho akalonga uudant'hi, alagisa viya eli, kwaviya yehe mwenye ni mdant'hi na tate wo udant'hi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Name Kwaviya nalonga ikindedi nivo vikuleka hamkunihuwila. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ni yuhi mwa nyuwe akudaha kulagisa kugamba miye hidamanya wavu? Miye nnalonga ikindedi nii nyuwe hamkunihuwila? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mnt'hu ywa Mnungu eva yadya ya Mnungu, Mna nyuwe hamkwiva Kwaviya hiyo wa Mnungu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wamhomola Yesu wakagamba, “Haluse suwe hakikulonga ikindedi kugamba weye hwi Msamalia naho una mp'hepo?” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Miye hina mp'hepo. Namtunya Tate, mna nyuwe hamkunitunya. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Mna miye hikuzungula ukulu, eyuko akuzungula ukulu uwo, niyehe akuunga asengele. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ikindedi namigambilani, mnt'hu aneva yadya hulonga haabanike chu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Mna Wayahudi niyo wamgamba, “Haluse kibunk'hula kugamba una mp'hepo iihile. Ibulahimu kabanika hamwenga na walotezi wose mna weye wagamba, Mnt'hu anatoza mahinizo yako haabanike chu.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Weye umkulu kujink'ha tati yetu Ibulahimu abanike. Na walotezi wose wa Mnungu wabanika, weye waketenda niwe ani? <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “nakeink'ha ukulu miye mwenye, nt'hunyo yangu hiyo kint'hu, akunitunya ni Tate, yudya nyuwe mkugamba Mnungu ywenyu. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Naho nyuwe hamummanyize mna miye himmanya, nnagamba himmanyize neninde mlulimi enga nyuwe, mna miye himmanya naho hitoza ulosi wakwe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Tati yenyu Ibulahimu na kanda na kinyemi kikulu, Kwaviya akuunga adione dizuwa dyo kwiza kwangu naho niyo adiona na kwelelwa.” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wamgamba, “Weye ukei kubuza myaka milongo mishano mna kumuwona Ibulahimu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ikindedi nawagambileni,” “Ibulahimu umwo andaga akei kwelekwa, ‘Miye ni aho’.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Niyo walogota maiwe vileke wamtoe, Yesu niyo akefisa nakufosa mwe nyumba ya Mnungu no kuhalawa.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ahonya mnt'hu elekwe mant'hunt'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Umwo Yesu andile akomboka, amuwonaga mnt'hu andaga mant'hunt'hu kukongela kwelekwa kwakwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamuuza, “Mhinizi, mnt'hu uyu na wadya wamweleke ni yuhi adamanye wiihi vilekile akalekwa mant'hunt'hu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu niyo ahitula, “Yuno hadamanye wiihi naho hata wadya wamweleke. Mna ivi vilaila vileke ndima za Mnungu zioneke. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naho yaungigwa kizidamanye zindima zakwe yehe akisigiile kukei nomsi, kilo cheza naho mnt'hu haadahe kudamanya ndima. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lupisi nili mwe isi, miye ni ung'azi we isi”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Eze ajink'he kulonga ivo, niyo atwa mate hasi, adamanya nt'hope kwa yadya mate, amhaka int'hope idya mwa meso, yudya andile nt'hunt'hu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Niyo amgamba, “Ita ukahake mwe dibilika dya Siloamu.” Zina Siloamu ni ulosi wa Kiibulania, nuko kugamba, “Atumigwe.” Basi niyo aita nao kuhaka mazi, niyo auya meso yakwe yaona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Want'hu we haguhi naye na wadya wamuwone kale viya endile hakuona, naho viya endile mlombezi, niyo wauza, “Haluse yuno hi yudya endile akekala na kulombeza?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Watuhu niyo wagamba, “Hiyo yehe mna kakaeiga du.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna yehe mwenye niyo agamba, “Miye ni yehe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Niyo wamgamba, “Kutenda vivihi vilekile ukaona?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yehe niyo awahitula, “Mnt'hu yudya akwitangwa Yesu nakadamanya nt'hope, niyo anihaka mwe meso, anigamba, ‘Ita Siloamu ukahake.’ Niyo naita nahaka mazi vatenda naona.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Niyo wamgambila, “E kuhi uyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yehe nae niyo awahitula, “Miye himanyize.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mafalisayo wauza mbuli ya kuhonyigwa mnt'hu tunt'hu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Niyo wamwigala kwe Mafalisayo yudya endile hakuona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Naho na inda mwe zuwa dya Kuhumula viya Yesu adamanye ziya nt'hope na kumgela yudya mnt'hu akanda aona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mafalisayo niyo wamuuza vituhu viya vendile niyo meso yakwe yanda yaona. Yehe niyo awagamba, “Nakanigela nt'hope mwe meso niyo nahaka mazi valekile ivi haluse naona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mafalisayo watuhu niyo wagamba, “Mnt'hu uyo halaile kwa Mnungu, kwaviya hakuitoza miko ya zuwa dya kuhumula.”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna watuhu niyo wauza, “Yadahika vivihi mnt'hu mta wiihi kudamanya vilagiso va vihungi?” Niyo woho wenye wanda wapangana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mafalisayo niyo wamuza vituhu uyo mnt'hu endile matunt'hu, “Togola, we mwenye wamgaze mnt'hu uyo akufumbule ameso yako?”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo awagamba, “Mnt'hu uyo ni mlotezi!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Vilongozi wa Wayahudi niyo wenda hawakuhuwila kugamba mnt'hu uyo andaga hakuona mpaka weze wawetange wadya wamweleke. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Niyo wawauza kugamba, “Yuno niye mwana wenyu mkugamba nakelekwa hakuona? Inda vivihi inde aona?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Welesi wakwe niyo wawahitula, “Suwe kimanya yuno niye mwana wetu, naho kimanya nakelekwa matunt'hu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mna inda vivihi akanda aona, suwe hakimanyize, naho hakimanyize uyo atendile akaona. Muuzeni yehe mwenye, Kwaviya yehe ni mnt'hu mkulu naawagambileni!” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Welesi wakwe nawalonga ivo Kwaviya nawakawogoha vilongozi wa Wayahudi Kwaviya vilongozi awo nawagambilana kugamba, mnt'hu yeyose analonga kugamba Yesu ni Kilisito naaguluswe mwe nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nivo vilekile welesi wakwe wakalonga, “Ni mnt'hu mkulu muuzeni yehe mwenye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Niyo wamwitanga kaidi yudya andile nt'hunt'hu, niyo wamgamba, “Mwink'he uwedi utendese Mnungu, ulonge kindedi! Suwe kimanya mnt'hu uyo ni mta wavu.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yudya mnt'hu niyo awahitula, “Uneva yehe ni mta wavu miye himanyize, himanya mbuli imwenga, nehinda nt'hunt'hu mna ivi haluse naona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Basi niyo wamuuza, “Nakakudamanyila mbwai? Nakakugubula meso vivihi yani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Niyo awahitula, “Himigambilani, mna hamkunihuwila. Kwa mbwai mwaunga kwiva naho vituhu? Nyuwe nanywe mwaunga mwinde wanamp'hina wakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Niyo wamhomola kugamba, “Weye u mwanamp'hina wakwe! Suwe ki wanamp'hina wa Musa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Suwe kimanya Mnungu nakalonga na Musa, mna yudya hakimmanyize uko alaile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yudya mnt'hu niyo awahitula, “Mbuli iyo ni ya kwehelesa! Nyuwe hammanyize uko alaile mna katenda meso yangu yande yaona! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kimanya kugamba Mnungu hakuwategelaza wata wavu, awategeleza want'hu wakumwogoha Mnungu na kudamanya yadya akuunga. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kukongela nk'hongo ye isi hakinati kive kugamba kuna mnt'hu agubule meso ya mnt'hu elekwe matunt'hu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Uneva mnt'hu uyo halaile kwa Mnungu, heedahile kudamanya mbuli yoyose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Niyo wamhitula, “Weye nokwelekwa na kukuila mo wavu! Ivi wadaha kukihiniza suwe?” Niyo wamgulusa kuse.</para>
  <para style="s">Utunt'hu wa kimuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu niyo eva kugamba wamgulusa mwe nyumba, umnt'hu yudya amhonyile, eze amuone, niyo amuuza, “Weye wamhuwila Mwana wa Mnt'hu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yudya mnt'hu niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, ni yuhi uyo vileke nimhuwile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Kumuwona, naho yudya akulonga na weye ivi haluse ni yehe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yudya mnt'hu niyo amvika nokumgamba, “Zumbe, nahuwila.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu niyo agamba, “Miye hiza umu mwe isi kwa mbuli ya usengelo wadya hewekuona waone, na wadya wakuanyanya kugamba waona wande mant'hunt'hu.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mafalisayo watuhu wandile hamwenga na yehe niyo weva viya alongile, niyo wamgamba, “Haluse wakigamba suwe naswe kimant'hunt'hu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mwandile mant'hunt'hu heguamwandile no uwavu mna mwagamba ‘Chaona’ ivo elo uwavu wenyu wekala.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mliganyo wa mdimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ikindedi namigambilani, yehe hekwingila mwe nk'hili yo mngo we zingoto mna ombokela kunk'handa uyo ni mbavi naho ni mhoki. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Akwingila mo lwivi yehe ni mdimi we zingoto. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwamizi amkomoela mdimi Kwaviya ngoto zammanya dizwi dyakwe, naho Kwaviya kazimanya amazina yawe azitanga no kuzigala kuse. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yanafosa kuse amagoto yakwe yose alongola na magoto yamtimila Kwaviya yamanya izwi dyakwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mtakwiza hazikumtimila kwaviya hazimmanyize diizwi dyakwe.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu nakawagambila mliganyizo uwo, mna woho hawakombaganye imbuli iyo awagambile.</para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Mdimi Ywedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagambila vituhu, “Ikindedi nawagambilani, miye nie ulwivi lwa magoto. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wose wanilongoele ni wabavi naho ni wahoki, naho magoto hayaweve. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Miye nulo umnango. Mnt'hu akuunga engile kwa kombokela miye naahone, naaingile nakufosa naho naapate nk'hande. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mbavi aneza eza vileke abawe, achinje, hamwenga na kubananga, miye hiza vileke wande na ugima naho wande nao wakubanikaluka.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Miye nie mdimi wedi, mdimi ywedi adaha kulava ugima wakwe kwajili yamagoto yakwe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mnt'hu akulihwa hiyo mdimi, Kwaviya yehe zingoto hiyo zakwe, anayaona magwema yeza azileka zingoto nokunyilika. Naho digwema dyazigwila na hamwenga nakuzimwaganisa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yehe anyilika kwaviya ni mnt'hu ywa kulihwa naho mbuli ye zingoto hiyo kint'hu kwakwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Miye nuyo mdimi ywedi, wadya wakwangu hiwamanya, wadya awangu wanimanya miye. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Enga viya Tate akunimanya, miye name nammanya. Miye naulava ugima wangu kwa mbuli ye zingoto. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Naho nnanazo ngoto nt'huhu zandile hiyo zo umngo uno zoho nazo naungigwa nizilete, naho nezive mluzi wangu. Naho nakunde na fyo dimwenga na mdimi yumwenga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Ivo elo niivo vilekile Tate akaniungisa, kwaviya naulava ugima wangu akajika nauguha naho vituhu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hahali mnt'hu akuulava ugima wangu mna ni miye mwenye. Name nnanawo udahi wakuulava, nnanawo udahi wa kuuguha naho vituhu. Mwiko uwo nehiink'higwa ni Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nia kwanda na kupangana mwe wayahudi kwa mbuli ye yadya Yesu alongile. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Awengi wawe niyo wagamba, “Uyu ana mp'hepo iihile naho mhezi! Mwamtegeleza wai?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Watuhu niyo wagamba, “Ulosi uwo hiyo wa mta mp'hepo iihile, haluse mp'hepo iihile yadaha kumtenda mnt'hu aone?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alemelwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kudya Yelusalemu no kunda na zuwa dya kinyemi ya kukumbukila ukuki we nyumba ya Mnungu naho neinda ni mwe nyota. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu andaga akagenda mwe nyumba ya Mnungu mwe ukumbi ya Sulemani. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wamzunguluka wakamgamba, “Haluse noukigele nk'huswank'huswa mpaka ini? Uneva weye niwe Kilisito Mkombozi hake kigambile ikindedi.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Nehiwagambila mna nyuwe hamkunihuwila, ndima izi hudamanya kwa zina dya Tate niizo zikunilavila uwona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mna nyuwe hamkuunga hamkunihuwila Kwaviya hiyo ngoto zangu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Zigoto zangu zawiva mluzi wangu, miye hizimanya zoho nazo zanitimila. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Miye name nazink'ha ugima wa ulo na ulo, nazo hezibanike, naho hahali mnt'hu akuunga azipokole kulawa mwe mikono yangu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tate anink'hile awant'hu awa ni mkulu kujink'ha wose. Naho hahali mnt'hu akudaha kuwaguha kulawa mwe mikono ya Tate. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Miye na Tate ni kitu kimwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo walogota maiwe vituhu vileke wamtoe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Zindima zedi nyingi zikulawa kwa Tate hiwalagisani, mwe indima ihi mwe izo ikutenda mnitoe maiwe?” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Mwe zindima izedi hakikukutoa maiwe, mna kwe mbuli ya kumlonga vihile Mnungu, naho Kwaviya weye umnt'hu mna waketenda Mnungu.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Togoleni haiwandikwe mwe miko yenyu kugamba, ‘miye hilonga nyuwe milungu?’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kimanya kugamba diya diwandikwe mwe Mawandiko Akukile nikindedi mazuwa yose, naho Mnungu kawetanga wadya want'hu milungu, want'hu wadya wenk'higwe ulosi wakwe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Tate kanisagula miye naho kanisigila mwe isi, togoleni ivi mwadaha kugamba namhomole Kwaviya hilonga miye nuuyo Mwana ywa Mnungu? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Uneva hikudamanya zindima za Tate zia akuunga nizidamanye, msekunihuwila. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mna nnazidamanya uneva hamkunihuwila miye huwileni zindima, vileke mmanye Tate ekala mndani mwangu name nekala mndani mwa Tate.” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Niyo wazungula naho kumgwila, mna niyo achupuluka mwe mikono yawe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Niyo akeitila gundi yo mto Yolodani mpaka hadya hant'hu Yohana andile akabatiza want'hu, niyo ekala uko. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Want'hu wengi niyo wambasa wakagamba, “Yohana hadamanye kilagiso chochose mna yose ayalongile Yohana mwe milosi na yanda ya kindedi.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Niyo want'hu wengi hadya wamhuwila Yesu.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">File Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kuna mnt'hu akwitangwa Lazalo endile akekala Besania, mnt'hu uyu andaga mnyonge. Besania na winda mzi akwikala Maliamu na lumbudye Masa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Maliamu uyu ni yudya amhakile mavuta Zumbe, yo mhemp'he mwo mtwi wakwe nakumhangusa ne zifili zakwe. Mkuluwe akwitangwa Lazalo nie andaga mnyonye. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wadya walumbuze niyo wamwigaila ulosi Yesu, kugamba, Zumbe “mbuyayo Lazalo alumwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu eze eve mbuli ino niyo alonga, “Unyonge uno homtende Lazalo abanike, unyonge uno ulaila vileke Mnungu enk'higwe ukulu ino naitende Mwana wa Adamu ahokele ukukile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu nakawaunga Masa na lumbudye hamwenga na Lazalo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu eze eve Lazalo mnyonge niyo enda ukudya endile kwa mazuwa matuhu maidi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Kiteni zatu Yudeya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamhitula, “Mhinizi, mazuwa mageke yomboke Wayahudi kudya nawakaunga kukutowa maiwe naho waunga kuuya uko?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Msi hikugaa una masaa mlongo na maidi, naho mnt'hu anagenda mwe ungazi wa nomsi hakukehamiza Kwaviya kuna nulu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mna anagenda nekilo naagwe kwaviya kuna ziza.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nakalonga ivi naho niyo ongezela, “Mbuyetu Lazalo kabanika mna nenite hamwinule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wamhitula, “Zumbe uneva kagona mnyonge naahone.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mna Yesu na kanda na ivo vo kugamba kabanika, mna woho nawakagamba na kanda kabanika kagona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagambila pwilili, “Lazalo kabanika.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mna miye nnakinyemi Kwaviya na kinda hakihamwenga na yehe vikuunga nyuwe mhuwile, haluseelo kiteni kwakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tomasi yudya akwitangwa pasa niyo awagambila wanamp'hina weyawe, “Kiteni chose hamwenga na mhinizi vileke kibanike hamwenga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye ufufuo na ugima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu eze abule niyo abwiila lazalo kabanika mwe mazuwa matatu yomboke. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Besania na handa hagihi na Yelusalemu, enga maili zikubula nt'hatu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>naho wayahudi wengi na weza kuwasangalaza Masa hamwenga na Maliamu kwa mbuli ya file ya ndugu yawe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Masa eze eve Yesu keza niyo afosa kuse vileke wadugane, mna Maliamu niyo asigala kundani kwe nyumba. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Masa niyo amgambila Yesu, “Zumbe, wandile aha mkulu ywangu hegu habanike! <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mna himanya Mnungu adaha akakwika dyodyose diya ukunga ulombeze hata ivi haluse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgammba, “nduguyo naauyuke.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Masa niyo amhitula, “Himanya naauyuke mwe zuwa dya uheelo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Miye nuwo uyulo no ugima. Wose wakunihuwila, wakeza kubanika nawande wagima. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Naho wose wakwikala na kunihuwila haweze wabanike. Weye wahuwila mbuli ino?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Niyo amhitula, “Heiye Zumbe!” “Nahuwila kugamba weye ni we Kilisito, Mwana Mnungu naakaungwa kwiza.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Masa eze ajike kulonga ayo auyaga niyo amwitanga Maliamu lumbudye kwa kinyele akamgamba, “Mhinizi e aha naho akuuza weye.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Malia eze eve niyo atenda nguvu aita kuse vileke akadugane naye. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu na kanda akei kubula mwe kaya mna na kanda hant'hu abwiilane na Masa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Elo Wayahudi wandile hamwenga na Maliamu wakamhembeleza niyo wamtimila weze wamuwone atenda nguvu kwinuka na kwiita kuse. Nawakagamba aita kwe kikuta kwiila uko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Maliamu niyo abula hadya andaga Yesu, eze ambwiile niyo agwa mwe viga akamgamba, “Zumbe wandile aha ndugu yangu hegu habanike!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amkaula ivo andaga akaila, niyo akaula wadya Wayahudi wandile hamwenga na Maliamu ivo nawakaila. Yesu niyo engilwa ni mbazi mwo moyo wakwe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awauza, “Mummoselahi msanga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamhitula, “Zumbe so ukaule.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu niyo anyukumila. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wagamba, “Kauleni ivo naakamuungisa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Watuhu niyo wagamba, “Hikugamba awatendaga mant'hunt'hu waone, nii hamtendile Lazalo asekubanika?”</para>
  <para style="s">Lazalo auyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu umwo andile akei na kinyulu mwo moyo abulaga he kikuta, iyo yandaga mp'hanga igubikwe na iwe mnanga mwo lwingiilo lwakwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba. “Diuseni diiwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Masa lumbudye dya mto kubanika niyo amhitula, “Zumbe, anunk'ha kwaviya ana mazuwa mane kukongela aho eze abanike”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Hikugambile una huwila nauone ukulu wa Mnungu?” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Niyo wadihausa diiwe, Yesu niyo akaula kulanga niyo agamba, “Tate nakutogola kwaviya wanitegeleza. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mna nalonga ivi kwa mbuli ya awa want'hu vileke wahuwile kugamba weye niwe uniletile.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Eze ajink'he kulonga ivi niyo alonga kwa izwi kulu, “Lazalo, so kuse!” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Lazalo niyo afosa kuse, mikono yakwe hamwenga na viga vikakigwa sanda, kihanga chakwe nacho kigubikwa kitambala. Yesu niyo awagamba, “Mhauseni isanda, naho mlekeni aite.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mzungu wa kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:1-5; Maliko 14:1-2; Luka 22:1-2</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Elo Wayahudi wengi wezile kwa Maliamu niyo waiona mbuli idya Yesu adamanye, niyo wamhuwila. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Watuhu niyo waita kwa Mafalisayo wakuwagambila ivo Yesu adamanye. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo hamwenga na wakulu wose niyo wadugana ne kitala chose wakagamba, “Kitende vivihi haluse? Kauleni vihungi ivo akudamanya!” <figure style="fig" desc="" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="11:47">Mlava nt'hambiko we Kiyahudi</figure> <verse number="48" style="v"/>Uneva kinamleka agendeele na ivi akudamanya, want'hu nawamhuwile naho Walumi naweze niyo wabananga nyumba ya Mnungu hamwenga na kukikaila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yumwenga ywawe andaga aketangwa Kayafa andaga mkulu wa walava nt'hambiko mwo mwaka udya niyo awagamba, “Nii mwanda wahezi! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Haluse hammanyize nevinde vedi mnt'hu yumwenga abanike kwa mbuli ya want'hu wengi kujink'ha kuleka isi ngima ikabanika?” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ikindedi halongile ivi kwa mbuli yakwe yehe mwenye, mna kwa kunda mlava nt'hambiko mkulu mwaka udya, naakalotela ukubanika kwa Yesu naafe kwa ajili ya Wayahudi. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Naho hiyo kwa woho du Mna kuwaduganya hamwenga mo umwili umwenga want'hu wose wa Mnungu wasaguke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kutimila zuwa diya, Wayahudi niyo wazungula sila ya kumkoma Yesu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu hagendaga akaoneka mwa Wayahudi. Ahalawaga niyo aita hant'hu hagihi ne dijangwa ko mzi ukwitangwa Efulaimu ukwo ekalaga hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Wila wa Wayahudi wa Pasaka wandaga hagihi. Want'hu wakwelaga kulawa kwe zink'honde zawe kwiita Yelusalemu, vileke wakekukize kwaviya na wakeika lumwe kwa Pasaka. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Niyo wamzungula Yesu. Umwo weze wadugane mwe nyumba ya kumvika Mnungu, niyo wakonga kuuzana woho kwa woho, “Wafanyanya mbwai? Kigambe haeze mwe zuwa dya kinyemi!” <verse number="57" style="v"/>Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na Mafalisayo nawasigila kugamba uneva kuna mnt'hu yeyose avile uko Yesu eli alonge vileke wamgwile.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu agelwa mafuta ko mzi wa Besania</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:6-13; Maliko 14:3-9</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mazuwa sita kubula mwe zuwa dya Pasaka Yesu niyo aita Besania kaya kwa Lazalo yudya Yesu amuuyula kulawa kwe file. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Niyo wamwambikila nk'hande ya nomsi, Masa niyo amdamanyila ndima. Lazalo na kanda yumwenga ya wadya wekale hamwenga na Yesu <verse number="3" style="v"/>Niyo Maliamu aguha nusu lita ya mavuta ya mhemp'he, amhake mavuta ayo Yesu mwe viga, naho niyo amhangusa ne zifili zakwe. Niyo idya inyumba yose yanda na mhemp'he wedi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yumwenga mwe wanamp'hina wa Yesu akwitangwa Yuda Isikaliyote, Yudya akuunga eze amsezenge niyo agamba, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Nii mavuta yano yedi yasekutagwa kwa matundu mengi naho niyo wenk'higwa want'hu haweena kint'hu?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nakalonga ivi naho hiyo Kwaviya naakawaungisa want'hu haweena kint'hu, mna Kwaviya na kanda mbavi naho yehe niye naakatoza umkoba wandile na matundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo alonga, “Mlekeni! Adamanya ivi kwa mbuli ye maziko yangu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mazuwa yose mnanao want'hu haweena kint'hu mna homnde na miye mazuwa yose.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lazalo azungulwa akomigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wayahudi wengi niyo weva kugamba Yesu emwo mzi wa Besania niyo waita kudya andile naho hiyo Kwaviya Yesu na kanda kudya, mna uleke wakamkaule Lazalo, yudya Yesu amuuyule mwe file. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Naho niyo wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wazungula sila vileke wamkome Lazalo, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kwaviya mbuli idya neikatenda Wayahudi wengi kuwalemela woho nakumhuwila Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu engila Yelusalemu kwa kinyemi</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 21:1-11; Maliko 11:1-11; Luka 19:28-40</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Zuwa dya kaidi want'hu wengi wezile mwe wila ye Pasaka niyo weva kugamba Yesu keza Yelusalemu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Niyo waguha matambi ye mitende nakugenda kumsingiila, kwa izwi nawakagamba, “Zumbe atogolwe, Mnungu amwink'he uvikilwa yudya akwiza kwa zina dya Zumbe, Mnungu amwink'he uvikilwa Zumbe we Izilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu niyo akwela mp'hunda enga viya iwandikwe, <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Mzi wa Sayuni usekogoha Zumbe ywako eza akweile mwana mp'hunda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe hawabunk'hule imbuli idya, mna Yesu eze atogolwe niyo wabunk'hula viya iwandikwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Want'hu wandile na Yesu hadya amwitange Lazalo kulawa mwe kikuta na kunda mgima niyo wasimwila viya vilaile. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ivo niivo valekaga want'hu wengi wakamwizila kwaviya na weva ivilagiso ve vihungi viya adamanye. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mafalisayo niyo wagambilana, “Kauleni ivo kikudunguga naho ulumwengu mgima wamtimila Yehe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Wagiliki wamwenga waunga wamwone Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mwe wadya want'hu wezile Yelusalemu mwe zuwa dya kinyemi watuhu nawanda Wagiliki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Niyo waita kwa Filipo, mnt'hu wa Betisaida mwe isi ya Galilaya wamgamba, “Zumbe, chaunga kimwone Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Filipo niyo agenda kumgambila Anduleya, wose waidi niyo waita wakumgambila Yesu. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Isa ibula Mwana wa Mnt'hu akuunga atogolwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nawagambilani ikindedi, mp'huluzi ye uhemba neisigale iivo imwenga hainahandigwe mwe ulongo niyo yafa. Uneva inabanika neyeleke mp'huluzi nyingi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wadya wakuuunga wikazi wawe nawazaganye na wadya hewekuunga wikazi wawe mwe ino isi nawawiike kwa mbuli ya wikazi wa ulo na ulo. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yudya akuunga kunidamanyila ndima miye naanitongele Kwaviya hadya huunga ninde mtumwa ywangu naande naye aho. Naho yudya akuunga anidamanyile ndima Tate naamwink'he ukulu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ye file yakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Haluse moyo wangu una kinyulu, haluse nigeeze? ‘Tate niyokole mwo lupisi ulu lukunizila.’ Mna iyo nivo vilekile miye heza vileke nombokele mwo lupisi ulo lwa masulumizo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tate, uketogole dizina dyako.”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo Izwi dyevika kulawa kwo ulanga, “Hiketogola kale naho neniketogole naho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Fyo dya want'hu wandile hadya niyo weva diya izwi, watuhu niyo walonga, “Neinda mtint'hilo naho watuhu niyo wagamba na kanda mtumigwa ywa kwe Mbingu alongile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mna Yesu niyo awagambila, “Izwi idi hadivike kwa mbuli yangu miye mna kwa mbuli ya nyuwe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Naho uno nuwo umuda wa ino isi kusengelwa, naho Mwavu mkulu we isi ino, naadulwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Umwo nnenulwa kulawa hasi, neniwaguhe want'hu wose kwangu.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mwo kulonga ivi, naakalongela ifile yakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Fyo dya want'hu niyo wamhitula, “Miko yakigambila Kilisito neekale mazuwa yose, nii weye naho wakigamba Mwana wa Mnt'hu neenulwe kulanga? Uyu Mwana ywo Mnt'hu ni yuhi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Ung'azi nounde na nyuwe kwa mda mguhi, gendeleeni Kwaviya mna ung'azi, ziza dinase kuwahumani, kwaviya yudya akugenda mwe diziza hamanyize kudya akwiita. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kwaviya mnanao ung'azi uhuwileni, vileke mnde want'hu wo ung'azi. Yesu eze ajink'he kulonga ivi niyo ahalawa na kugenda kukefisa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Want'hu waswesa kuhuwila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hamwenga nakugamba Yesu nakadamanya vilagiso mwa meso yawe mna woho hawahuwile. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ivo niyo viya valongagwa ni Mlotezi Isaya vakelaviliza.</para>
  <para style="q">“Zumbe, ni ani akuhuwila mbuli kikulonga?</para>
  <para style="q">Ni kwa ani udahi wa Mnungu ukunga ukelavilize?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Naho nawenda hawakuunga kuhuwila, Kwaviya Mlotezi Isaya nakalonga naho,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Mnungu kawagela u nt'hunt'hu ameso yawe,</para>
  <para style="q">hamwenga na kuitenda mioyo yawe inde midala,</para>
  <para style="q">wanase wakanihitukila vileke niwahonye.</para>
  <para style="q">Naho mioyo yawe inase ikakombaganya,</para>
  <para style="q">wanase wakanihitukila,</para>
  <para style="q">vileke miye niwahonye,”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Isaya nakalonga ivi Kwaviya nakauona ukulu wakwe Yesu na kuzilonga zimbuli zakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Naho mwe wakulu we Wayahudi nomnda na watuhu wengi wandile wakamhuwila Yesu, mna kwa ajili ye Mafalisayo nawanda hawakulonga imbuli ino mwe kiyeti wanase wakaguluswa kulawa mwe nyumba ya Mnungu. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kwaviya nawakaungisa kwink'higwa ukulu na want'hu kujink'ha ikwink'higwa ukulu na Mnungu.</para>
  <para style="s">Ulosi wa Yesu walava usengelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesu niyo alonga kwa kubongeela, “Yudya akunihuwila miye hiyo anihuwila miye du, mna amhuwila na yudya aniletile. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yudya anione miye kamuwona hata yudya aniletile. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hiza mwe Isi ninde ung'azi vileke yudya akunihuwila miye asekwingila mwo lwiza. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yudya akwiva ulosi wangu niyo hakuutimila hikumsengela, miye hizile kwa mbuli ya kuwasengela want'hu wa isi mna kuwahonya. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Wadya wakunilemela miye hamwenga na ulosi wangu eyuko yumwenga akuunga awasengele. Ulosi udya nilongile nuwo ukuunga uwasengele mwe dizuwa dya uheelo. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Iki ni kindedi kwaviya hilongile kwa udahi wangu miye mwenye mna Tate yudya aniletile miye nie anisigiile yo kulonga. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Naho himanya miko yakwe zenk'hiza ugima wa ulo na ulo, yadya nilongile ni yadya Tate akisigiile miye nilonge.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu asunt'ha wanamp'hina wakwe iviga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Neinda disigala zuwa dimwenga kubula zuwa dya Pasaka. Yesu nakamanya isa yakwe ibula ya kuhalawa mwe isi na kuita kwa Ise. Naho naakawaunga wadya wandile wakwe mwe isi. Mazuwa yose naakawaunga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu na wanamp'hina wakwe nawanda mwe nk'hande ya nekilo. Mwavu nakamwingila kale Yuda mwana wa Simoni Isikaliyote mo umoyo uleke amsezenge Yesu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu nakamanya kugamba Tate kaika kila kint'hu mwo udahi wakwe. Nakamanya keza kulawa kwa Mnungu naho naauye uko kwa Mnungu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niyo akimaala hadya andile niyo aita kunk'handa no kuhambula isuke yakwe yandile mnanga mwe kitambala kituhu, niyo akekaka mwe kigudi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu niyo agela mazi mwe dikalai, no kukonga kuwasunt'ha wanamp'hina wakwe iviga hamwenga na kuwahangusa na kitambala chandile mwe kigudi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Niyo abula kwa Simoni Petulo, mna Simoni niyo amuuza, “Zumbe, weye unisunt'he iviga vangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Haukudaha kukombaganya ivi haluse imbuli ino hudamanya, mna nouwize ubunk'hule mwa mazuwa yakwiza.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Petulo niyo amgambila Yesu, “Weye hukudaha kunisunt'ha miye iviga vangu.” Yesu niyo amhitula, “Hinakusunt'hile iviga vako, hukudaha kunda mwanamp'hina ywangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo niyo amhitula, “Zumbe usekunisunt'ha iviga vangu du mna hata mikono hamwenga no mtwi wangu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu niyo agamba, “Ahakile kale hakuungwa kuhaka umwili mna ahaka iviga du. Kwaviya kasunt'hika kale umwili wakwe. Nyuwe msunt'hika mna hiyo wose.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nakamanya yudya akuunga amsezenge nivo vilekile akalonga, “Hiyo wose msunt'hike.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yeu eze ajinke kuwasunt'ha iviga vawe niyo avala idya isuke yakwe na kuuya hadya hant'hu hakwe andile nakekala no na kuwauza wanamp'hina wakwe, “Togoleni, mwakombaganya ayo nimidamanyileni?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Mwanitanga miye Mhinizi hamwenga na Zumbe, naho mwadamanya vedi ivo mkudamanya, kwaviya ivo niivo nili. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Miye ni Zumbe na Mhinizi ywenyu naho hiwasunt'ha iviga vyenyu nyuwe nanywe mwaungwa msunt'hane iviga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hidamanya mliganyizo vileke nyuwe nanywe mdamanye enga viya miye niwa damanyileni. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Namigambilani ikindedi, mtumwa hiyo mkulu kujink'ha zumbe ywakwe, naho mwigala ulosi hiyo mkulu kujink'ha yudya amwigale. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Naho ivo mmanyize kindedi neinde vedi mdamanye enga ivo mmanyize.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Hikulonga kwa nyuwe nyose, hiwamanya wadya niwasagule, mna vileke yadya yawandikwe yakint'he, kugamba, ‘Yumwenga kikudya hamwenga kanihituka no kunitendela vihile!’ <verse number="19" style="v"/>Namigambilani, mbuli ino ikei kulaila vileke inalaila mhuwile kugamba, ‘Miye ni Yehe.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nawagambilani kindedi, yudya akumhokela yudya ni mwigale anihokela miye, na akunihokela miye amhokela yudya anigale miye.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga mbuli ye kusezengwa kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:20-25; Maliko 14:17-21; Luka 22:21-23</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu eze ajink'he kulonga ivi, niyo abanika mnyunk'humilo mo umoyo wakwe. Niyo awagamba, “Namigambilani ikindedi yumwenga ywenyu naanisezenge.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wakaulana woho wenye, wakauzana uyo akulongigwa ni ani? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mwanamp'hina yumwenga, yudya naakaungiswa na Yesu nakeekala hagihi na Yesu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo niyo amhungila mkono akamgamba, “Muuze Zumbe uyo akulongigwa ni ani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Niyo yudya mwanamp'hina asogelesa hagihi na Yesu na kumuuza, “Zumbe, mnt'hu uyo ni ani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Uyo huunga nchank'hize mkate mwe kaziga, na kumwink'ha ni yehe.” Niyo aguha kabesu ko mkate na kukachank'hiza mwe kaziga na kumwink'ha Yuda mwana Simoni Isikaliyote. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yuda eze ajink'he kuudya udya mkate Mwavu niyo amwingila. Yesu naye niyo amgamba, “Tenda nguvu idyo ukudamanya.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Naho hahali hata mnt'hu yumwenga akombaganye, nii Yesu nakalonga viya kwa Yuda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwaviya Yuda andaga akatoza mkoba wa matundu, wanamp'hina watuhu nawakafanyanya kugamba Yesu nakamsigila aite kokuguha vint'hu nevikaungigwa kwa mbuli ye zuwa dya kinyemi ye Pasaka hegu kuwenk'ha wakiwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yuda niyo ahokela umkate nakufosa kuse, naho neinda nekilo.</para>
  <para style="s">Sigilizi mp'hya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yuda eze afose Yesu niyo agamba, “Haluse elo Mwana ywa Mnungu katogolwa na Mnungu Katogolwa mndani mwakwe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Uneva ukulu wa Mnungu ugubulwa mndani mwo Mwana, Ivo Mnungu na alagise ukulu wo Mwana mndani mwakwe mwenye Naho naatende ivo nguzu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wana wangu, heninde na nyuwe lupisi lutali mna nomnizungule, nawagambila viya niwagambile wakulu wa Wayahudi, ‘Hamkudaha kuita kudya huunga nite miye.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Naho ivi haluse nawenk'hani sigilizi mp'hya, ‘Muungane enga viya miye niwaungile, kila yumwenga amuunge miyawe.’ <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mnaungana, kila yumwenga naamanye kugamba muwanamp'hina wangu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alonga viya Petulo akuunga amlemele</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:31-35; Maliko 14:27-31; Luka 22:31-34</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo niyo amuuza Yesu, “Zumbe waitahi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Uko huita hukudaha kunitimila haluse, mna nowize unitimile.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Petulo niyo amuuza, “Zumbe, nii hikudaha kukutimila ivi haluse, miye nadaha kubanika kwa mbuli yako weye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Kindedi weye wadaha kubanika kwa mbuli yangu miye? Nakugambila ikindedi, iviya zogolo dikei kuila, diyelo naulonge nk'hanana nt'hatu kugamba hunimanyize!”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu sila ya kuita kwa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba wanamp'hina wakwe, “Msekogoha, mwamhuwila Mnungu, nihuwileni miye name. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mwe nyumba ya Tate, mna wikazi mwingi, naho miye nagenda kuwaikilani lumwe hant'hu ho kwikala, vandile hiyo ivo hegu nehimigambilani. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nnaita nnajika kumiikilani lumwe, nenize niwaguheni vileke mnde hadya huunga ninde miye. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naho muimanya isila idya ikuita kudya huunga niite.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tomasi niyo amgamba Yesu, “Zumbe hakimanyize kudya ukuita haluse nekimanye vivihi isila ikuunga ikibuze uko?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Ni miye sila ne ikindedi, no ugima, Hahali akuunga aite kwa Tate hanombokele kwangu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Kwaviya mnimanya miye nomumanye Tate naye, naho kukongela ivi haluse mummanya Tate naho mmuona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Filipo niyo amgamba, “Zumbe, suwe icho kikuunga ukilagise Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Filipo kwa lupisi lutali nehinda na nyuwe nyose, mna hamnimanyize? Anione miye, kamuona Tate. Nii naho mwanigamba, ‘Kilagise Tate?’ <verse number="10" style="v"/>Filipo, mkei hamkuhuwila kugamba miye nimndani mwa Tate, na Tate naye emndani mwangu? Ulosi humigambilani haukulawa kwangu” mna Tate emndani mwangu nie akudamanya izindima. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Huileni viya hulonga kugamba, Tate emndani mwangu miye name ni mndani mwakwe. Uneva hukuhuwila idyo huwila ziya zindima hudamanya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Namigambilani ikindedi, wadya wakunihuwila nawadamanye yadya hudamanya miye, kindedi, naho nawadamanye mbuli zikujink'ha izi, kwaviya miye naita kwa Tate. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Naho nenidamanye chochose kiya mkuunga kwa zina dyangu, vileke ukulu wa Mnungu uoneke kombokela kwa Mwanawe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mnalombeza chochose kwa zina dyangu, neniwadamanyileni.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Muye ywa Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mnaniunga miye, nomyatoze yadya huwasigiilani. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nenimlombeze Tate naho naawenk'heni mwambizi mtuhu akuunga ekale na nyuwe ulo na ulo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yehe ni Muye akulonga ikindedi cha Mnungu. Want'hu wa mwe isi hawakudaha kumhokela Kwaviya hawakudaha kumuwona naho hawammanyize. Mna nyuwe mummanya Kwaviya ekala na nyuwe naho e mndani mwenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ninaita, hamkudaha kusigala nyuwe wenye, neniwaamileni naho. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwe lupisi mgeke ukwiza want'hu wa mwe Isi hawakudaha kuniyona naho vituhu, mna nyuwe namnione, naho Kwaviya ni mgima hata nyuwe na mwinde wagima. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Zuwa idyo dinabula, nammanye kugamba miye nimndani mwa Tati ywangu naho na nyuwe mndani mwangu, enga viya miye nendile mndani mwenyu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Wadya wakutimila miko yangu nakuitimila, awo nawo wakuniunga. Tate yangu naawabwede wadya wakuniunga miye, hata miye neniwabwede nakukelaviliza kwa woho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yuda, Mna hiyo Yuda Isikaliyote niyo amgambila Yesu, “Zumbe, nainde vivihi kwa weye kukelaviliza kwa suwe naho hiyo kwa want'hu wamwe Isi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Yudya akuniunga naayazumile mahinyo yangu, Tate naambwede, naho miye hamwenga na Tate nakize kwakwe nakwikala kwakwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yudya hakuniunga miye, hakuyazumila mahinizo yangu, naho mahinizo myevile hiyo yangu, mna yeza kulawa kwa Tate yudya aniletile miye mwe ino Isi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Himigambilani ivi, Kwaviya nikei nili na nyuwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwambizi, Muye ywa Mnungu, Yudya Tate akuunga amwigale kombokela dizina dyangu, naawahinizize nyuwe kila kint'hu, naho naawakumbuseni nyuwe mbuli zose niwahinizizeni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Utondowazi namwasilani nyuwe, utondowazi wangu nawenk'kani. Hikuwenk'hani enga viya isi ikuwenk'ha. Msekogoha naho msekunda na kinyulu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Na mwiva miye himigambilani, ‘Namwasani mna nenize naho vituhu.’ Uneva namniunga namuunga kugamba miye naita kwa Tate, Kwaviya yehe ni mkulu kujink'ha miye. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Himigambilani mbuli izi zikanda zikei kulaila, vileke yanalaila nyuwe mhuwile. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hikudaha kugendeela kulonga na nyuwe, Kwaviya yudya akulongoza ino isi eza. Hana udahi kunijika miye, <verse number="31" style="v"/>mna si zose zaungwa zimanye kugamba namuunga Tate, ivo nivo vilekile nadamanya kila kint'hu kiya akunigamba nidamanye.</para>
  <para style="p">“Soni! Kihalaweni aha hant'hu.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu niye mzabibu we kindedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Miye nie mzabibu we kindedi, naho Tate yehe niye mkulima. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tambi hedikweleka adihausa mwangu, naho ayahogowela vedi matambi yadya yakweleka vedi, vileke yande hang'aile yelekese. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nyuwe msunt'higwa kale kwaviya yo ulosi udya niwek'heni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ikaleni mndani mwangu, name nenikale mndani mwenyu. Tambi hadikudaha kweleka dikanda ikedu, mna dyadaha dikeleka dinanda mwo mzabibu, enga iivo hamkudaha kweleka hamnekale mndani mwangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ni miye mzabibu nyuwe nanywe mwi matambi. Wadya wakwikala mndani mwangu, miye name mndani mwawe, nawelekese, kwaviya hamkudaha kudamanya dyodyose hamnandile na miye. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mnt'hu hanekale mndani mwangu naadulwe kuse enga tambi, niyo dya nyala, matambi ayo yaduganywe hamwenga nakugeligwa mwo moto vileke yahye. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mnekala mndani mwangu niyo ulosi wangu wekala mndani mwenyu, lombezeni chochose mkuunga, nanywe nomwink'higwe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nyuwe mna damanya mbuli zedi Tate naatogolwe, naivo nemanyike kindedi kugamba mwi wanamp'hina wangu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Miye nawaunga enga viya Tate akuniunga miye. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mnazumila miko yangu namwikale mwe lukunde lwangu, enga viya miye nizumile miko ya Tate ywangu nakwikala mwe lukunde lwakwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Himigambilani ivi vileke ikinyemi changu kinde mndani mwenyu na kinyemi changu kikint'he <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sigilizi yangu ni ino. Muungane enga viya miye niwaungile nyuwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lukunde lutendese mnt'hu ananawo ni udya ukulava ugima wakwe kwa wambuya zakwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nyuwe mwinde wambuya zangu Mkudamanya yadya huwagamba. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Miye hikuwetangeni naho nyuwe wandima, Kwaviya mtumwa hamanyize yadya akudamanya Zumbe wakwe, mna nawetanga wambuya Kwaviya hiwagambilani kila kint'hu nikivile kulawa kwa Tate. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nyuwe hamnisagule miye, mna miye himisaguleni nyuwe nakuwasigilani mwite na kweleka matunda yakuunga yekale. Naho Tate naawenk'he kint'hu chochose kiya mkunga kombokela dizina dyangu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Vino niivo humigambilani, Muungane kila yumwenga na mnyawe.</para>
  <para style="s">Isi naiwalemele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Uneva want'hu wanawaihiyeni mmanye kugamba nawakonga kuniihiwa miye. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uneva nyuwe ni wa ino isi, want'hu we isi hegu nawawaunga kwaviya ni wa ino isi. Mna himisaguleni nyuwe kulawa mwe ino isi, icho niicho kilekile want'hu wakawaihiya. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kumbukileni viya nimigambileni, wandima hiyo wakulu kujink'ha Zumbe wawe, uneva want'hu nawanisulumiza miye hata nyuwe nawawasulumizeni, uneva nawatimila mahinizo yangu nawatimile ya kwenyu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mna nawawadamanyizile mbuli zose izi Kwaviya nyuwe ni wa kwangu miye, Kwaviya hawammanyize yudya akisigiile miye nize. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Uneva hezile na kulonga nawo hawandile na wiihi enga ivi haluse kwaviya hawana dyodyose wakudaha kukegombela. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mnt'hu akuunga aniihiye miye amwihiya Tate. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Uneva hidamanye mbuli izo niwadamanyizile, naho hahali mnt'hu yeyose akudaha kudamanya nawende hawana masa yo wiihi, mnawaona ivo miye nidamanye niyo wani ihiya miye hamwenga na Tate. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mna ino ilaila vileke imbuli iwandikwe mwo Mwiko ikilavilize, ‘Nawaniihiya haheina chotoko chochose.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Mwambizi neeze, Muye akuunga alavilize ikindedi cha Mnungu, yehe akulawa kwa Tate. Muye ywe kindedi naalonge uwona mwa miye. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Naho hata nyuwe namlonge mbuli zangu kwaviya mwandaga na miye kukongela aho nk'hongo.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Nahiwagambileni vileke mnasemkaileka imani yenyu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Namguluswe mwe zinyumba za kumvikila Mnungu, naho lupisi naubuze, want'hu nawamanye kugamba yudya akuwakoma nyuwe naende mwe kudamanya Ibada kwa Mnungu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Want'hu nawawadamanyizileni vint'hu ivi Kwaviya hawammanyize Tate. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mna himigambilani ivi vileke umuda unabula wa woho kudamanya ivi, nakumbukile ivo miye niwagambileni.</para>
  <para style="s">Indima yakwe mp'heho msuntilwa</para>
  <para style="p">“Aho nk'hongo himigambilani ivi Kwaviya na hinda hamwenga na nyuwe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mna ivi haluse naita kwa yudya aniletile, mna hahali hata yumwenga akunuuza uko hwiita. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mna Kwaviya himigambilani imioyo yenyu inda na kinyulu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mna nawagambilani ikindedi, na inde vedi kwa nyuwe uneva nnaita Kwaviya hinaitile mwambizi heeze kwenyu, mna nnaita naho waleteleni umwambizi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Aho aneza naawa lavanyile want'hu we isi ino kugamba hawe mwe kindedi mwe mbuli yo wavu hamwenga na mbuli zo kwelela na usengelo wa Mnungu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwe imbuli yo wavu waga Kwaviya hawakunihuwila miye. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwe mbuli ye ikindedi waga Kwaviya naita kwa Tate naho hamnione, <verse number="11" style="v"/>Naho waga mwe imbuli ye usengelo Kwaviya mkulu we isi ino kasengelwa kale. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nnanazo mbuli nyingi zakuwagambila mna ivi haluse homdahe kuyafinyiliza. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Muye aneza akuunga alavilize ikindedi cha Mnungu naawaigale mwe kindedi, haalonge zimbuli zakwe yehe mwenye mna naalonge zimbuli ziya akutegeleza, naho naawagambileni mbuli ziya zikwiiza. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yehe eze anitogole miye Kwaviya naaguhe yadya miye hulonga nakuwagambilani nyuwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yose ananayo Tate ni yangu miye ivo nivo vilekile miye halonga, Muye naaguhe ya kwangu miye nakuwagambilani nyuwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kinyulu hamwenga na kinyemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Mwe lupisi mdodo ukwiza hamnione, naho mwe lupisi mdodo ukwiza namnione vituhu”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wauzana woho wenye, “Ino ina maana yani? Kakigambila kugamba, mwe lupisi mdodo ukwiza hakimuwone naho, vituhu mwe lupisi mdoodo ukwiza nakimuwone, naho kalonga, ‘Kwaviya naita kwa Tate.’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na kanda na maana yani viya akalonga, ‘Lupisi mdodo?’ Hakimanyize idyo akulonga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu na kamanya kugamba waunga wamuuze niyo awagamba, “Hilonga, ‘Mwe lupisi kidodo hamnione, naho mwe lupisi mdodo namnione.’ Mbuli ino niyo mkukiuza nyuwe wenye? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Namigambilani ikindedi, na mwiile na kwiila, mna want'hu wa isi na wande na kinyemi. Na minde na kiholozi mna ikiholozi chenyu na kihituke kunda kinyemi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mvele ananda haguhi a kweleka, anda na kinyulu kwaviya lupisi lwakwe lwe masulumizo lubula, mna uneva mwana anelekwa ajala amasulumizo yose, kwaviya ana kinyemi kwa mwana elekwa mwe isi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ivo niivo mnanavo nyuwe. Ivi haluse mna kinyulu, mna nakaona naho vituhu mioyo yenyu imemile kinyemi. Ikinyemi icho hahali mnt'hu akuunga awahoke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Mwa dizuwa idyo, homniuze kint'hu chochose. Nawagambilani ikindedi, Tate naawenk'he chochose mlombeza kwa zina dyangu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kubula ivi haluse mkei kulombeza kint'hu chochose kwa dizina dyangu, lombezeni naho nomhokele vileke ikinyemi chenyu kikint'he.</para>
  <para style="s">Kuzihuma mbuli za mwe isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Hilonga kwa miliganyizo kuwagambilani zimbuli izi, mna lupisi nolubule henilonge naho kwa miliganyizo. Mna nenilonge pwilili mwe mbuli ya Tate. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mwe dizuwa idyo, nomlombeze kwa zina dyangu. Naho hikuwagambilani kugamba, neniwalombezeleni, <verse number="27" style="v"/>kwaviya Tate mwenye awaungani. Awaunga kwaviya nyuwe nanywe mwaniungaga, naho mhuwila kugamba hiza kulawa kwa Mnungu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hiza kulawa kwa Tate naho hiza kwe isi, naho ivi haluse nahalawa mwe isi naita kwa Tate.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Niyo wanamp'hina wakwe wamgamba, “Ivi haluse walonga haheina kifiso, naho hiyo kwa miliganyizo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kimanya ivi haluse kugamba wamanya kila kint'hu. Hukuunga mnt'hu akuuze mbuli. Kwa ivi cha huwila kugamba kulawa kwa Mnungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awahitula, “Haluse mwahuwila? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lupisi lweza naho lubula, hadya nyuwe nyose nomsambale kila yumwenga naaite kwe kaya naho nomnase nikedu. Mna miye hikedu kwaviya Tate e hamwenga na miye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Himigambileni ivi vileke mnde na utondowazi mwa miye mani kwa kunda mlunganyika hamwenga na miye. Mwe si mna makunt'ho, mna keink'heni moyo miye hiihuma si.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalombezela wanamp'hina wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu eze abinde ukulonga yano niyo akaula kulanga na kulonga, “Tate udya lupisi ubula, Mtogole mwanao ulehe yehe naye akutogole. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwaviya nakumwink'ha mwanao udahi mwa want'hu wose, vileke awenk'he ugima wa ulo na ulo wadya wose umwink'hile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Na ugima wa ulo na ulo ni uno, kukumanya wenye we ekedu Mnungu wa kindedi hamwenga na Yesu Kilisito umsigile. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Miye hikutogola hano he isi, naho hiibindiliza idya ndima unink'hile niidamanye. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Haluse Tate, unink'he ukulu udya nandile nao aho isi ikei kuumbigwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Hikutenda umanyike kwa wadya want'hu unink'hile kulawa kwe isi, nawanda want'hu wako ni weye wanink'ha wande want'hu wangu nawo wauzumila ulosi wako. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Haluse wamanya kugamba kila kiya unink'hile kilawa kwako. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Miye hiwenk'ha udya ulosi unink'hile, woho nao wauhokela naho wamanya kindedi kugamba ulawa kwako hamwenga na kuzumila kugamba kindedi hilawa kwako naho weye niye unisigile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Nawalombelezela woho, hikuilombelezela isi mna nawalombelezela wadya unink'hile, Kwaviya ni wako. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yose nnanayo ni yako, naho ya kwako ni ya kwangu, naho ukulu yangu wonekana kwa wadya unink'hile. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Naho ivi haluse neza kwako, himuli mwe isi mna woho wamwe isi, Tate msuntilwa kwa udahi dizina dyako unink'hile, naungisa uwaike wande kint'hu kimwenga enga viya sue kili umwenga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Viya nendile hamwenga nao nahiwaika vedi kwa udahi we dizina dyako unink'hile. Miye nahiwaamila naho hahali hata yumwenga mwe woho agile, mna ni yudya mwana agile uleke Mawandiko Akukile ukelavilize. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mna ivi haluse neza kwako, mna hilonga mbuli izi mwe isi vileke washiliki hamwenga na miye ikinyemi nnanacho. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Miye hiwenk'ha ulosi wako naho want'hu wa isi niyo wawaihiwa Kwaviya woho hiyo wa isi enga viya miye name hiyo wa isi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hikulombeza uwahause kulawa mwe isi, mna nalombeza uwahonye na yudya Mwavu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Woho hiyo wa mwe isi enga viya miye. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Waike wande wakukizwe mwe kindedi, ulosi wako ni kindedi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Enga viya unisigile miye mwe isi, miye name nawasigila woho mwe isi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Naho kwa mbuli ya woho miye mwenye nakeika nikukizwe vileke woho nawo wande wakukizwe mwe kindedi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Hikuwalombezela woho du mna Nawalombeza hata woho wakunga wahuwile kwa ulosi wao. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nalombeza vileke wose wande kint'hu kimwenga. Tate, Nalombeza wande mndani mwetu enga viya weye undile mndani mwangu name mndani mwako. Nalombeza wande kint'hu kimwenga uleke want'hu wa mwe isi wahuwile kugamba weye niye unisigile. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Miye hiwenk'ha ukulu udya unink'hile miye vileke wande kint'hu kimwenga enga viya suwe kili umwenga. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Miye ninde mndani mwawe nawe mndani mwangu, nalombeza wakint'hizwe kunda kint'hu kimwenga, vileke isi imanye kugamba weye nakunisigila. Naho wawaunga woho enga viya ukuniunga miye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Tate naunga wadya unink'hile wande hamwenga na miye hadya huunga nili, vileke wauone udya ukulu wangu unink'hile Kwaviya nakuniunga kukongela viya isi ikei kuumbigwa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tate ywedi, isi haikukumanya, mna miye hikumanya. Wano nao wakumanya kugamba weye niye unisigile. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hikutenda umanyike kwawe naho nenigendeele kukutenda ivo, vileke lukunde wandile nao kwangu unde mndani mwawe name ninde mndani mwawe.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">1 Yesu agwiligwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:47-56; Maliko 14:43-50; Luka 22:47-53</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu eze alonge ayo, niyo aita ng'ambu yo mto Keduloni, hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe. Hant'hu aho handaga na bustani, Yesu niyo engila Umwo hamwenga na wanap'hina wakwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yuda, Yudya amsezenge Yesu, nakahamanya hant'hu aho kwaviya nk'hanana nyingi Yesu naakadugana na wanamp'hina wakwe uko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Niyo, Yuda aguha kafyo ka watowani na wamizi kulawa kwa wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko na Mafalisayo, nokwizanao kwe ibustani. Nawanda na vimuli na magala hamwenga na vitoanilo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu, Kwaviya nakamanya yadya yose yakuunga yamlaile niyo awezila na kuwauza, “Mwamzungula ani?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Woho nao niyo wamhitula, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” Yesu niyo awagamba, “Ni miye.” Yuda yudya akumsezenga na kanda kakimala haguhi na woho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Umwo Yesu eze awagambe, “Ni miye.” Niyo wauya kunyuma, na kugwa hasi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu awauza naho, “Mwamzungula ani?” Niyo wamhitula, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Hiwagambilani kale kugamba ni miye, haluse uneva mwanizungula miye walekeni wano watuhu wakeitile.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nakalonga ivo vileke yadya alongaga yakelavilize, “Tate hezile hata yumwenga mwe wadya unink'hile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo andaga na bamba, niyo adisomola no kumsenga digutwi dya kulume mtumwa wa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu. Mndima uyo naaketangwa Maliko. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba Petulo, “Vuza idibamba dyako mwe yala. Togola, nise kunywela ikikombe che masulumizo anink'hile Tate?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu egalwa kwa Ananasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wadya wank'hondo wawayahudi, niyo wamgwila Yesu na kumkakiliza luzigi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>naho niyo wanda kumwigala kwa Anasi. Anasi na kanda ise vyala dya Kayafa yehe andile mlava nt'hambiko mkulu mwe mwaka uwo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Naho Kayafa nuyo awagambile Wayahudi kugamba, yaungigwa mnt'hu yumwenga abanike hant'hu ha want'hu wengi.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo amlemela Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo hamwenga na mwanamp'hina niyo wamtimila Yesu. Yudya mwanamp'hina mtuhu na kanda kamanyika kwa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu, niyo engila hamwenga na Yesu kundani hant'hu hakuduganikila ha mlava nt'hambiko mkulu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mna Petulo andaga kakimala kuse hagihi no umnango, Mna yudya mwanamp'hina mtuhu andile akamanyika na Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu niyo afosa kuse na kulonga na mvele yumwenga andile ho mnango amlekela Petulo engile kundani. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yudya mvele ho mnango niyo amgamba Petulo, “Weye wi yumwenga mwa wanamp'hina wa uyu mnt'hu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo niyo amhitula, “Miye hiyo mwa woho.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wandima hamwenga na wamizi nawakweleza moto niyo wanda wotela Kwaviya na kunda na mp'heho. Petulo naye na kanda hamwenga na woho akotela moto.</para>
  <para style="s">Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu amuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 26:59-66; Maliko 14:55-64; Luka 22:66-71</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Niyo mlava nt'hambiko mkulu amuuza Yesu, mwe mbuli ya wanamp'hina wakwe hamwenga na mahinizo yakwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Nehilonga na kila mnt'hu haheina kukefisa, Lupisi wose nahihiniza mwe zinyumba nk'hulu za Mnungu hamwenga na mwe nyumba za Mnungu mdya wakuduganikila wayahudi wose naho hina idyo nilongile kwa kukefisa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ni mbwai kuniuza miye? Wauze wadya wanivile. Wauzeni yadya niwagambile, wayamanya yadya niwagambile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Eze alonge ayo mwamizi yumwenga andile kakimala aho niyo amtowa Yesu, no kumgamba, “Togola, nivo ukumhitula mlava nt'hambiko mkulu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu amhitula, “Uneva hilonga vihiye, lagisa uwo wiihi. Mna uneva hilonga vedi, wanitoelai?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Niyo Anasi amwigala Yesu ivo akakilizwe, kwo mlava nt'hambiko mkulu uyo Kayafa.</para>
  <para style="s">1 Petulo amlemela naho Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Simoni naye Petulo andaga akei aaho akotela moto. Basi, niyo wamuza, “Togola, weye nawe wiyumwo mwa wanamp'hina wakwe?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo niyo ahitula. “Bule, hiyo miye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yumwenga mwa wandima wa mlava nt'hambiko mkulu yudya akantigwe idigutwi ni Petulo, amuzaga, “Togola, miye hikuwone weye kwe bustani hamwenga na uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Petulo alemelaga naaho, aaho zogolo niyo dyaila,</para>
  <para style="s">1 Yesu egalwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:1-2, 11-14; Maliko 15:1-5; Luka 23:1-5</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Basi, niyo wamguha Yesu kulawa kwa Kayafa, no kumwigala kwe nyumba ye kiseuta. Yandaga kilokilo, vileke wadahe kudya pasaka, hawengile mwe nyumba yo uzumbe wanase kugeligwa usavu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kwa ivo, Pilato awabasaga uko kuse no agamba, “Mna mlahowani no mnt'hu uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Niyo wamhitula, “Uneva uyu hiyo Mwavu hegu hakimletile kwako.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pilato niyo awagaba, “Hayani, mguheni nyuwe wenye, mkamsengele vikuligana ne miko yenyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">Wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Suwe hakina udahi wa kumkoma mnt'hu yoyose.” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nevinda ivo vileke ukelavilize ulosi udya Yesu alongaga kugamba, naafe file yani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pilato niyo engila vituhu kwenyumba ikwitangwa ikulu, amwitanga Yesu na kumuza, “Hambwe weye niwe Zumbe ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Togola, izi ni mbuli zako hegu want'hu wakugambilaga zimbuli zangu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Pilato niyo amhitula, “Togola, Miye ni Myahudi? Kabila dyako naho wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko wakuleta kwangu. Kubanangai?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Useuta wangu hiyo we isi ino, Uneva Useuta wangu wandile we isi ino, wandima wangu na wanigombela nisekugeligwa mwe mikono ya Wayahudi. Mna haluse Useuta wangu hiyo wa aha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Aho Pilato niyo amgamba, “Haluse weye wi Zumbe.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu amhitula, “Weye kulonga kugamba miye ni Zumbe. Miye hyelekwa kwa mbuli ino imwenga, kulonga ikindedi, mkindedi yeyose naanitegeleze.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pilato niyo amgamba, “Ikindedi ni kint'hu chani?”</para>
  <para style="s">1 Yesu asengelwa file</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato eze alonge ivo, niyo awabasa naho Wayahudi niyo awagamba, “Miye hione mbuli yoyose iihile kwakwe. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mna yaungigwa miye niwakomoele mvugailwa yumwenga mwe pasaka. Haluse mwaunga niwakomoele Zumbe ywa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Aho niyo wata kubongeela, “Bule! Hiyo uyo, kikomoele Balaba!” Uyo Balaba andaga mhoki wa vint'hu want'hu.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Niyo Pilato amguha Yesu no kugenda kumtoa mikotya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wank'hondo niyo wadamanya taji ya miwa niyo wamvala mo mtwi, naho niyo waguha suke ye zambalau nakumvala. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Niyo wamwizila nakumgamba, “Wikale mp'heho Zumbe wa wayahudi.” Naho niyo wagendeela kumtoa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilato niyo afosa kuse kaidi nokudigamba idifyo dya want'hu. “Kauleni, mguheni mnt'hu uyu vileke mmanye kugamba miye hikuona wiihi wowose mwo mnt'hu uyu.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Niyo Yesu afosa kuse availe taji ye miwa mwo mtwi naho kavaligwa suke ya zambalau. Pilato niyo awagamba, “Kauleni mnt'hu uyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Niyo wadya wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko hamwenga na wandima wawe weze wamuwone wakonga kugutila wakagamba, “Muwambe! Muwambe Pilato!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Wayahudi niyo wamhitula, “Kina miko ikugamba aungwa kukomwa, kwaviya aketanga Mwana wa Mnungu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pilato eze eve ivo niyo engilwa na wogofi mkulu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Niyo auya kwe nyumba yo ulava nt'hambiko no kumuuza Yesu, “Weye kulawahi?”</para>
  <para style="p">Mna Yesu hamhitule. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pilato niyo amgamba Yesu, “Hukuunga kulonga na miye? Umanye, nna udahi wa kukulekela weye unde mwenye nyumba naho nna udahi wakukuwamba mwo mti wa masulmizo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Una udahi mwa miye Kwaviya nokwink'higwa ni Mnungu, yudya aniletile kwako anawiihi mkulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pilato eze eve ivo, niyo azungula sila ya kumlekela Yesu. Mna idifyo dya Wayahudi niyo dyagutila, “Uneva unamlekela hounde mbuya na Seuta ywa Kilumi, mnt'hu yeyeso anaketenda Zumbe naende haaivane na seuta ywa Kilumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pilato eze eve ivo want'hu nawakalonga, niyo amguha Yesu no kuita naye kuse no kwikala mwe ukalo wakwe wo usengelo hant'hu hakwitangwa sakafu ya maiwe kwa ulosi wa Kiibulania nahaketangwa, “Gabasa.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Naho neinda nomsi want'hu wakakeika lumwe kwa pasaka. Pilato niyo awagamba Wayahudi, “Zumbe wenyu uyu eaha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Niyo wagutila, Mkome, mkome, muwambe!</para>
  <para style="p">Pilato niyo awauza, “Nyuwe mwaunga miye nimkome Zumbe wenyu?”</para>
  <para style="p">Wakulu wa walava nt'hambiko niyo wamhitula, “Suwe hakina Zumbe yeyose mna Seuta ywa Kilumi uuyo du.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Pilato niyo amwink'hiza mwe mikono yawe vileke awambigwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awambigwa</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:32-44; Maliko 15:21-32; Luka 23:26-43</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamguha Yesu vileke wamuwambe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu niyo afosa kuse no kwinula msalaba wakwe wa masulumizo mpaka hant'hu hakwitangwa “Kibela cha mtwi” kwa Kiibulania Goligota. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wamuwambaga hadya, hamwenga na want'hu watuhu waidi, Yumwenga kumoso na wakaidi mkono wakwe wa kulume, Yesu nae andaga hagati. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pilato nakawandika mwe kabao niyo kaikigwa halanga he msalaba, “YESU MNAZALETI ZUMBE WA WAYAHUDI.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wayahudi wengi nawasoma Kwaviya hant'hu hadya Yesu awambilwe na handa hiyo hale na ho mzi. Naho nayaandikwa kwa Kiibulania, kilumi hamwenga na Kigiliki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mlava nt'hambiko mkulu niyo amgamba Pilato, “Usekuwandika, ‘Zumbe wa wayahudi mna uyu mnt'hu naakagamba, miye ni miye Zumbe wa wayahudi.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato niyo awahitula, “Yadya niwandike haya kuhitulwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wank'hondo weze wajike kumuwamba Yesu, niyo waguha isuke yakwe nakuipanga mafungu mane, kila yumwenga na fungu dyakwe. Naho niyo waguha nk'hazu yakwe naho nk'hanzu idya ne inda haisumigwe mna ita kufumigwa kukongela kulanga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wadya wank'hondo niyo wagambana, “Kisekuitatula mna kitowe kula kikaule ni ani akuunga aink'higwe.” Uleke ukelavilize Mawandiko Akukile udya Mawandiko Akukilegwe,</para>
  <para style="q">“Naawakepangila zisuke zangu,</para>
  <para style="q">no kuitoela kula nk'hanzu yangu.”</para>
  <para style="m">Iivi nivo wadamanye wadya wank'hondo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wandaga hagihi no msalaba hadya awambilwe Yesu wandaga, ni nine dya Yesu, lumbudye dya nine dya Yesu, Maliamu mkaziwe dya Kiliopa, hamwenga na Malia Magedalena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amuwona nine hamwenga na yudya mwanamp'hina amuungisaga wakimala, niyo amgamba nine, “Uyo nuyo umwanao.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Naho niyo amgamba yudya mwanamp'hina ywakwe, “Uyo nuyo nyokwe.” Kukongela aho yudya mwanamp'hina niyo amgumha yudya nine no kugenda kwikala nae kwe nyumba yakwe.</para>
  <para style="s">File ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:45-56; Maliko 15:33-41; Luka 23:44-49</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kukongela hadya, Yesu nakamanya kugamba kila kint'hu nechajika, naho vileke kila Mawandiko Akukile ukint'he, niyo agamba, “Naona nk'hilu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nahanda na kiyamp'ha kimemile siki, niyo watufika ditambala idyo mwe kiyamp'ha kine siki, niyo wadi zinganiza mwa kaziti katali, niyo wamwink'hiliza mwo mnomo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu eze ajink'he kuinywa idya siki niyo afunamiza mtwi hasi akagamba, “Isila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ajungwa gola mwo lubavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Niyo wadya wakulu wa wayahudi waita na kumlombeza Pilato vileke awenk'he kuwavuna iviga wadya want'hu wawambigwe, hamwenga no kuiseleza imili yawe. Nawamuuza ivi Kwaviya neinda ijumaa, naho hawaungile imili iyo ikale mwe misalaba viwambilo mwe dizuwa dyo kuhumula. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Niyo wank'hondo waita na kuvuna iviga va yudya mnt'hu wa nk'hongo hamwenga na mtuhu, wadya want'hu wawambigwe hamwenga na Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mna weze wabule kwa Yesu niyo wambwila kabanika kale vilekile hawamvunile iviga vakwe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mnk'hondo yumwenga niyo mtunga Yesu na mkuki wakwe mwo lubavu lwakwe, aaho niyo mwalawa sakame na mazi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yudya aone na kalonga naho yadya alongile ni ya kindedi naho kamanya kugamba alonga kindedi naho alonga ivo vileke nyuwe nanywe mhuwile. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ino na inda ivi vileke yadya yawandikwe yande kindedi, “Hadihali hata vuha dyakwe dimwenga divunigwe.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Naho yeyuko Mawandiko matuhu ya Mnungu yakugamba, “Want'hu nawamkaule yudya wamjungile mkuki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aikigwa mwe kikuta</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 27:57-61; Maliko 15:42-47; Luka 23:50-56</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yeze yajike, na handa na mnt'hu yumwenga etangagwa Yusufu, endile akekala ko mzi wa Alimatayo, niyo aita kwa Pilato na kumlombeza umwili wa Yesu, Mnt'hu uyu andaga mwanamp'hina Yesu kwa kinyele Kwaviya naakawogoha vilongozi we Kiyahudi. Pilato niyo amzumila uleke auguhe mwili wa Yesu, Yosefu aitaga niyo auguha umwili wa Yesu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nikodemo yudya aitaga kwa Yesu nekilo, niyo aita hamwenga na Yusufu naho nakaguha manemane hamwenga na udi ukubula madebe maidi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Wagosi awa waidi niyo wauguha umwili wa Yesu na kuuvunganiza sanda, enga viya wayahudi wandaga wakadatenda, mwo kuuikia lumwe umwili vileke umoswe msanga. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Na handa na nk'honde haguhi na hadya Yesu awambigwe, naho na handa na kikuta chandile kikei kumosa msanga mnt'hu yeyose <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kwaviya neinda mwe kuikila lumwe kwa Wayahudi mwa zuwa ya kuhumula, niyo wauwika umwili wa Yesu kwe mp'hanga yandile hagihi.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kikuta mzungu mnt'hu</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:1-8; Maliko 16:1-8; Luka 24:1-12</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mtootondo zuwa dya nk'hongo dya juma, Umwo kwandile kukei mavukuvuku, Maliamu Magedalena nakaita kwe kikuta, niyo abwiila diiwe dihauswa kulawa mwe mnango we kikuta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Niyo aguluka kuita kwa Simoni Petulo hamwenga na mwanamp'hina mtuhu yudya Yesu naakamuungisa, niyo awagambila, “Wauguha umwili wa Zumbe mwe kikuta, naho hakimanyize aho waikile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Niyo Petulo hamwenga na wanamp'hina watuhu waita mwe kikuta. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Waidi wawe niyo waguluka, mna yudya mwanamp'hina mtuhu niyo agulukisa kumjink'ha Petulo, awo wanda wa nk'hongo kubula he kikuta. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Niyo afunama akaula kundani, no kuiona isanda ihank'handa, mna heingile kundani. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kunyuma kwakwe niyo eza Simoni petulo, yehe niyo ita kundani kwe kikuta. No kubwiila vitambala ve isanda vihank'handa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hamwenga na suke afungilwe Yesu mwo mtwi wakwe. Havandile hamwenga ne sanda, ila neivunyangizwa hank'handa yoho yenye. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Niyo mwanamp'hina mtuhu yudya andile wa nk'hongo kubula he kikuta, niyo yehe naye engila kundani kwe kikuta niyo aona hamwenga nakuhuwila. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Niyo wanda hawakombaganye Mawandiko Akukile udya noukagamba naauyuke kulawa mwo kubanika. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Niyo wadya wanamp'hina wajuya kaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu amlaila Maliamu magidalena</para>
  <para style="r">Matayo 28:9-10; Maliko 16:9-11</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Maliamu niyo akimaala akaila haise he kikuta. Viya andile akei akaila, niyo afunama akakaula kundani mwe kikuta. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Niyo awaona mtumigwa ywaidi wavaile suke zing'aile wekale hant'hu handile no umwili wakwe Yesu, yumwenga ko mtwi na wakaidi kwe viga. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Niyo wamuuza, “Mvele wailai?”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo amhitula, “Wamguha Zumbe ywangu, Naho himanyize uko wamwiikile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Niyo ahituka kunyuma amuwona Yesu kakimala, mna habunk'hule kugamba andaga ni Yesu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amuuza, “Mvele wailai? Wamzungula ani?” Maliamu akafanyanya kugamba uyo andaga ni yudya akuikaula ibustani, akamgamba, “Mkulu, nigambile uko umwikile name nehamguhe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Maliamu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo amhitukila nokulonga naye mwe Kiibulania, “Laboni!” Nuko kugamba, “Mhinizi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba, “Usekunitoza, Kwaviya nikei kuuya kulanga kwa Tate. Mna ita ukawagambile ndugu zangu kugamba, nauya kwa Tate yangu naho hata woho ni Tati yawe. Mnungu wangu naho Mnungu ywawe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Niyo Maliamu Magedalena aita nakuwagambila wanamp'hina kugamba kamuwona Zumbe. Naho kamsigiila eze awagambile.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanamp'hina wakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neinda nekisingi zuwa dya nk'hongo dya juma, wanamp'hina nawanda we mwe nyumba wakevugaila zinyivi Kwaviya nawakawogoha wakulu wa wayahudi. Yesu niyo awalaila akimaala hagati hawe na kuwagamba, “Utondowazi nounde na nyuwe.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Eze ajink'he kulonga ivi, niyo awalagisa mikono yakwe hamwenga no lubavu lwakwe. Wanamp'hina wakwe niyo wanda na kinyemi kikulu Kwaviya wamuwone Zumbe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba naho, “Utondowazi nounde na nyuwe, enga viya tate anisigiile miye, miye name nawasigiilani nyuwe.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Eze ajink'he niyo awavikila no kuwagamba, “Hokeleni Muye ywa Mnungu.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mnawausila want'hu wavu wawe nawausilwe, hamna wausile hawakudaha kuusilwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yumwenga mwe wadya mlongo na waidi, akwitangwa Tomasi hegu pasa, andaga hahali hamwenga na wadya wanamp'hina weyawe viya Yesu akawalaila. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina watuhu niyo wamgamba, “Kimuona Zumbe!”</para>
  <para style="p">Tomaso niyo awagamba, “Uneva hione zink'hovu ze mitunga mwe mikono yakwe hamwenga na kugela kadole mwe zink'hovu na kugela mkono mwo lubavu lwakwe, hikudaha kuhuwila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Juma dimwenga dizedyomboke wanamp'hina na wanda hamwenga kwe nyumba, Tomasi na kanda hamwenga na woho. Umnango nounda uvugalwa mna Yesu niyo eza no kwingila niyo akimaala hagati na kuwagamba, “Utondowazi nounde na nyuwe.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amgamba Tomasi, “Gela kadole kako aha, naho kaula mikono yangu. Naho lete umkono wako uugele mwo lubavu lwangu. Usekukunda hwiina mhuwi uhuwile!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Tomasi niyo amhitula, “Zumbe ywangu na Mnungu ywangu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Niyo Yesu amgamba, “Kuhuwila kwaviya kaniona? Ni vedi kwa wadya wakuhuwila haheina kuniyona.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mwa meso ya wanamp'hina wakwe Yesu nakadamanya vilagiso vingi heviwandikwe mwe kitabu iki. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mna aya yawandikwa vileke want'hu wahuwile kugamba Yesu niye Kilisito Mwana ywa Mnungu, na kwa kuhuwila mdahe kunda na ugima kwa ludole lwe dizina dyakwe.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu awalaila wanamp'hina mfungate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu eze awalaile naho wanamp'hina wakwe kwe bahali ya Tibelia, vandaga ivi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo na Tomasi akwitangwa pasa hamwenga na Natanaeli mkaya wa Kana ya Galilaya na wana waidi wa Zebedayo hamwenga na wanamp'hina wakwe watuhu waidi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Simoni Petulo niyo awagamba, “Nagenda kulowa zisamaki.” Niyo wamhitula, “Nekiitanye hamwenga na weye.” Niyo waita kuse na kwingila mwe ngalawa, mna mwe kiya kilo chose hawapatile samaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mtondo zuwa dika tontomoka, Yesu niyo akimaala hank'handa he bahali, mna wanamp'hina wakwe na wanda hawabunk'hule kugamba ni yehe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Niyo Yesu awetanga no kuwauza, “Wambuyazangu, togoleni! Hamgwiile chochose?”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo wamhitula, “Hakipatile kint'hu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Niyo awagamba, “Duleni lwavu lwenyu mkono wo kulume we ingalawa, nomlowe.” Ivo niyo waduula no kudunduga kwinula lwavu kundani kwe ngalawa kwaviya nawalowa samaki zibindile ingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Niyo yudya mwanamp'hina aungiswe ni Yesu amgamba Petulo, “Uyu ni Zumbe Yesu.” Simoni Petulo eze eve kugamba yudya andaga ni Zumbe Yesu, niyo akevala suke yakwe idya aihambule umwo andile mwa mazi, niyo apilika mwa mazi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wanamp'hina wamwenga niyo wamtimila ne ngalawa wakavuta lwavu lumemile samaki, kwaviya na wanda hawehale no kunk'handa kwe bahali, na wanda enga nk'hacho gana dimwenga, kubula kunk'handa kwe bahali. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Weze waseele hasi, niyo wabwiila moto hamwenga na samaki ikokigwa, hamwenga na mkate.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Nink'heni samaki izo mlowile.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Niyo Simoni Petulo aita mwe ngalawa akonga kuvuta ulwavu kulawa kwa mazi lumemile samaki nk'hulu zikubula gana dimwenga na milongo mishano na nt'hatu. Samaki nezinda nyingi mna lwavu halutatuke. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu niyo awagamba, “Soni mdye!” Hahali hata mwanamp'hina yeyose amuuzile Yesu kugamba, “Weye niwe ani?” Kwaviya nawammanya andaga ni Zumbe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu niyo aguha mkate nokuwenk'ha, niyo atenda iivo kwe samaki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Naho ino neinda malavo ya Yesu ya katatu akawalaila wanamp'hina wakwe umwo eze ande kauyuka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu hamwenga na Petulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Weze wajike ukudya, Yesu niyo amgamba Simoni Petulo, “Simoni mwana Yohana, weye waniunga kujink'ha woseni awa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Simoni niyo amhitula, “Heiye Zumbe, kumanya kugamba nakuungisa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo amgamba, “Dima Zingoto zangu.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kaidi naho, Yesu niyo amgamba, “Simoni mwana Yohana, waniungisa?”</para>
  <para style="p">Niyo ahitula, “Heiye Zumbe, kumanya kugamba nakuungisa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo amgamba, “Dima zingoto zangu.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Katatu naho, Yesu niyo amgamba, “Simoni mwana Yohana, waniunga?”</para>
  <para style="p">Petulo niyo engilwa ni kinyulu kwaviya Yesu nakamuuza nk'hanana ya katatu “Weye waniunga?” Niyo amgamba, “Zumbe kumanya kila kint'hu, kumanya kugamba miye nakuunga!”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu niyo amgamba, “Dima zingoto zangu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ikindedi nakugambila, umwo wandile mdodo noukahina na kuita kokose kudya noukaunga, mna unadalahala nowinule mikono yako niyo mnt'hu mtuhu akuguha nakukwigala kunt'hu hwikukuunga.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu alongaga ivi akalagisa ivo Petulo akuunga abanike nakumwink'ha Mnungu ukulu. Yesu niyo amgamba, “Nitimile.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na wanamp'hina watuhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Petulo niyo ahituka kunyuma, niyo amuwona yudya mwanamp'hina naakaungiswa ni Yesu atimila. Niye yudya ekeegamile mwe kifua cha Yesu umwo wandile holudyo no kumuuza, “Zumbe akuunga akusezenge niani?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Petulo eze amuone, niyo amuuza Zumbe Yesu, “Zumbe, uyu mnt'hu naye?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu niyo amhitula, “Uneva naunga ekale mpaka aho heza kuuya, weye waiungilai!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Niyo mbuli idya yagendezwa mwa wandugu awo kugamba mwanamp'hina yudya haabanike. Mna Yesu halongile kugamba habanike mna nakagamba, “Uneva nnaunga ekale mpaka aho heza kuuya, weye wayaungilai?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mwanamp'hina uyu niye alongile zimbuli izi, naho ni yehe ayawandike, naho nakamanya yadya naakayalonga ayawandike ya kindedi.</para>
  <para style="s">Nkomelezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Naho kuna mbuli zibindile ingi Yesu azidamanye, uneva zose zawandikagwa imwe imwe, nikindedi kugamba si yose hayakint'hile, ivitabu ivo.</para>
</usx>
